(264943, 17804, 3540, '<td valign="top">The floating effect does it for me in this pic.  Good choice of colors and numbers.  Its a good medium in terms of the proximity of the bears to the camera, not too close nor too far.  Great job, the best I''ve seen so far. - 9</td>', 'The floating effect does it for me in this pic.  Good choice of colors and numbers.  Its a good medium in terms of the proximity of the bears to the camera, not too close nor too far.  Great job, the best I''ve seen so far. - 9', '2003-04-14 05:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
