(264949, 18206, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrayal of the textures of these particular candies.  A little extra noise around them is a bit unsightly, but not a major deduction.  Still congrats on the textures of these.  I think that really makes this photo.</td>', 'Excellent portrayal of the textures of these particular candies.  A little extra noise around them is a bit unsightly, but not a major deduction.  Still congrats on the textures of these.  I think that really makes this photo.', '2003-04-14 05:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
