(264954, 18129, 3540, '<td valign="top">I have to think this is something like the 2 in 1 feature on the oly 5050.  I don''t know any other way to change the focal length so radically in one page except to have a printed one cut out next to it or something.  Good illustration of unique technique, but I don''t really think it makes for a more pleasing photo.  More intriguing to the photographer methinks than aesthetically good.</td>', 'I have to think this is something like the 2 in 1 feature on the oly 5050.  I don''t know any other way to change the focal length so radically in one page except to have a printed one cut out next to it or something.  Good illustration of unique technique, but I don''t really think it makes for a more pleasing photo.  More intriguing to the photographer methinks than aesthetically good.', '2003-04-14 05:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(264957, 18211, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very cute and funny and a pretty good picture especially for this time of year. - 8</td>', 'Very cute and funny and a pretty good picture especially for this time of year. - 8', '2003-04-14 05:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
