(264972, 18029, 3540, '<td valign="top">That looks like a lot of work.  Unfortunately the execution of this pic was not the greatest.  Its not focused properly and pretty grainy.  From the thumbnail I thought this would win.  Great idea, but just not a great photo too.</td>', 'That looks like a lot of work.  Unfortunately the execution of this pic was not the greatest.  Its not focused properly and pretty grainy.  From the thumbnail I thought this would win.  Great idea, but just not a great photo too.', '2003-04-14 06:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(264973, 18264, 3540, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed for my personal tastes.  THe yellows are just a little too bright.  The color of the red is good now.  I wonder if the red would stay the same or even close if the exposure of the whole pic was turned down a bit.</td>', 'A little overexposed for my personal tastes.  THe yellows are just a little too bright.  The color of the red is good now.  I wonder if the red would stay the same or even close if the exposure of the whole pic was turned down a bit.', '2003-04-14 06:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
