(266484, 18062, 4494, '<td valign="top">Ummmmm, I love those.  Great shot of them also!</td>', 'Ummmmm, I love those.  Great shot of them also!', '2003-04-14 22:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(266485, 17980, 772, '<td valign="top">good composition, but the focus seems to be a bit soft and the pink cast across the image doesn''t seem to work very well overall... - setzler</td>', 'good composition, but the focus seems to be a bit soft and the pink cast across the image doesn''t seem to work very well overall... - setzler', '2003-04-14 22:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(266487, 17940, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but the effect doesn''t seem to accent the candy... - setzler</td>', 'Interesting image, but the effect doesn''t seem to accent the candy... - setzler', '2003-04-14 22:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(266489, 18013, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty neat.  You should have blasted the bottom of the candy with light to really light it up.  You''d need 1000W lights probably.</td>', 'Pretty neat.  You should have blasted the bottom of the candy with light to really light it up.  You''d need 1000W lights probably.', '2003-04-14 22:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(266490, 18211, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s great!  Very creative!  And a great pic also.  8.</td>', 'Wow, that''s great!  Very creative!  And a great pic also.  8.', '2003-04-14 22:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(266492, 17650, 4494, '<td valign="top">How did you make them look like they are falling?  Great!</td>', 'How did you make them look like they are falling?  Great!', '2003-04-14 22:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(266496, 18206, 4494, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little off.  Too dark I think.</td>', 'Lighting is a little off.  Too dark I think.', '2003-04-14 22:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(266498, 18232, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very, VERY cool.  You got lucky finding that setup!  And great lighting/cropping, and the background is nicely blurred also.  9.  You''re the winner so far. ;)</td>', 'Very, VERY cool.  You got lucky finding that setup!  And great lighting/cropping, and the background is nicely blurred also.  9.  You''re the winner so far. ;)', '2003-04-14 22:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(266499, 18153, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice eye candy! :)</td>', 'Nice eye candy! :)', '2003-04-14 22:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(266500, 18127, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, feeding candy to your turtle, I''ve seen it all now. :D  Very good, clean shot.</td>', 'LOL, feeding candy to your turtle, I''ve seen it all now. :D  Very good, clean shot.', '2003-04-14 22:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(266506, 17951, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shot.  I like the unobtrusive background.  A little bit of red left in some areas.  How do you do this?</td>', 'Pretty good shot.  I like the unobtrusive background.  A little bit of red left in some areas.  How do you do this?', '2003-04-14 22:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(266507, 18146, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting interpretation of ''candy''... i hope this gets some amount of voter support :) - setzler</td>', 'interesting interpretation of ''candy''... i hope this gets some amount of voter support :) - setzler', '2003-04-14 22:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(266510, 18105, 4494, '<td valign="top">Excellent I really love it.  One of the few times that the border complements the picture.  Really great.  10!</td>', 'Excellent I really love it.  One of the few times that the border complements the picture.  Really great.  10!', '2003-04-14 22:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(266516, 18115, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice set of elements in the picture!</td>', 'Nice set of elements in the picture!', '2003-04-14 22:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(266542, 18272, 4494, '<td valign="top">There''s a little bit too much "hard light" in the middle... maybe two software lights to illuminate the foreground would be better, but great picture anyway!</td>', 'There''s a little bit too much "hard light" in the middle... maybe two software lights to illuminate the foreground would be better, but great picture anyway!', '2003-04-14 23:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(266560, 18184, 4494, '<td valign="top">Oh man those are my favorites!!  Great colors.</td>', 'Oh man those are my favorites!!  Great colors.', '2003-04-14 23:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(266564, 18258, 5767, '<td valign="top">Very creative composition.  A little overexposed.</td>', 'Very creative composition.  A little overexposed.', '2003-04-14 23:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(266565, 18137, 5767, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective.</td>', 'interesting perspective.', '2003-04-14 23:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(266566, 18088, 5767, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white.  Good to see someone enter something with the old time candies.  Jacks and ball add a lot to the "story" here, too.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white.  Good to see someone enter something with the old time candies.  Jacks and ball add a lot to the "story" here, too.', '2003-04-14 23:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(266567, 17804, 5767, '<td valign="top">Creative composition, good exposure.</td>', 'Creative composition, good exposure.', '2003-04-14 23:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(266569, 18125, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great title for this submission.  Maybe a little underexposed?</td>', 'Great title for this submission.  Maybe a little underexposed?', '2003-04-14 23:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(266571, 18262, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea but you should have DEFENITELY focused on the girl and red "hot tamilis" instead of the jar, since the jar isn''t really the subject.   Very creative anyway, 8.</td>', 'Very cool idea but you should have DEFENITELY focused on the girl and red "hot tamilis" instead of the jar, since the jar isn''t really the subject.   Very creative anyway, 8.', '2003-04-14 23:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(266572, 18029, 5767, '<td valign="top">WOW.  You took a lot of time and care in creative this.  Seems like there\''s a little too much flash and contrast applied.</td>', 'WOW.  You took a lot of time and care in creative this.  Seems like there\''s a little too much flash and contrast applied.', '2003-04-14 23:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(266574, 18224, 5767, '<td valign="top">SMOKIN'' !</td>', 'SMOKIN'' !', '2003-04-14 23:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(266575, 17980, 5767, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.</td>', 'Nice and simple.', '2003-04-14 23:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(266577, 18062, 5767, '<td valign="top">Good exposure on this one.  Creative composition and good use of your wide angle lens.</td>', 'Good exposure on this one.  Creative composition and good use of your wide angle lens.', '2003-04-14 23:38:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(266578, 18243, 4494, '<td valign="top">Hmm, there''s to much box in the picture.  Should have tried to zoom in on the one on the left, leaving just a little bit of the box showing (the top of it), and possibly a little of the candy on the right (but a small amount).</td>', 'Hmm, there''s to much box in the picture.  Should have tried to zoom in on the one on the left, leaving just a little bit of the box showing (the top of it), and possibly a little of the candy on the right (but a small amount).', '2003-04-14 23:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(266580, 18123, 5767, '<td valign="top">Ahhh.  The skittle invasion.  It only takes one, you know.  Good use of your focus depth and your exposure is nicely done, too.</td>', 'Ahhh.  The skittle invasion.  It only takes one, you know.  Good use of your focus depth and your exposure is nicely done, too.', '2003-04-14 23:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(266584, 18262, 5767, '<td valign="top">You''ve definitely created a mysterious effect here.  Nicely done.</td>', 'You''ve definitely created a mysterious effect here.  Nicely done.', '2003-04-14 23:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(266585, 18272, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great use of repeatitive patterns.  You must be lucky to have access to all this chocolate.</td>', 'Great use of repeatitive patterns.  You must be lucky to have access to all this chocolate.', '2003-04-14 23:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(266587, 18153, 5767, '<td valign="top">Good title.</td>', 'Good title.', '2003-04-14 23:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(266589, 17797, 5767, '<td valign="top">This seems to be out of focus.  Great use of colors.</td>', 'This seems to be out of focus.  Great use of colors.', '2003-04-14 23:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(266590, 18202, 5767, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and your title tells it all.</td>', 'Nice composition and your title tells it all.', '2003-04-14 23:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(266594, 18105, 5767, '<td valign="top">Here we go.  Excellent image.  Great use of your patterns, excellent exposure and your composition is right on.</td>', 'Here we go.  Excellent image.  Great use of your patterns, excellent exposure and your composition is right on.', '2003-04-14 23:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(266596, 17842, 5767, '<td valign="top">Very creative approach and your subject and composition are excellent.  There''s no clutter in the background to detract from what you''re photographing.  Excellent entry.</td>', 'Very creative approach and your subject and composition are excellent.  There''s no clutter in the background to detract from what you''re photographing.  Excellent entry.', '2003-04-14 23:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(266598, 18084, 5767, '<td valign="top">This is a fun entry.  I had a similar idea.  You did a good job with this and the lighting and the sparkle in the background really add to the "cocktail" theme.</td>', 'This is a fun entry.  I had a similar idea.  You did a good job with this and the lighting and the sparkle in the background really add to the "cocktail" theme.', '2003-04-14 23:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(266602, 17951, 5767, '<td valign="top">Very "lady &amp; the tramp"-esque.  Great use of selective color.  Your lighting and exposure are just right (maybe a little bright on the shirts, but not a big deal).  Fun personality conveyed by the subjects.  Overall excellent.</td>', 'Very "lady & the tramp"-esque.  Great use of selective color.  Your lighting and exposure are just right (maybe a little bright on the shirts, but not a big deal).  Fun personality conveyed by the subjects.  Overall excellent.', '2003-04-14 23:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(266603, 18178, 5767, '<td valign="top">Nice shade of lipstick.  It works here.</td>', 'Nice shade of lipstick.  It works here.', '2003-04-14 23:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(266606, 18165, 5767, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and interesting lines in your chocolates.</td>', 'Nice exposure and interesting lines in your chocolates.', '2003-04-14 23:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(266607, 17749, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and composition. Very creative.  Overall good entry.</td>', 'Great lighting and composition. Very creative.  Overall good entry.', '2003-04-14 23:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(266610, 18232, 5767, '<td valign="top">I dont'' think I''ve ever seen this many gumballs in one place before.  You''ve captured this well.  Nice that you kept the background blurry and unrecognizable.</td>', 'I dont'' think I''ve ever seen this many gumballs in one place before.  You''ve captured this well.  Nice that you kept the background blurry and unrecognizable.', '2003-04-14 23:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(266611, 18057, 5767, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and swirls.  Good composition - really close up and personal.</td>', 'Love the colors and swirls.  Good composition - really close up and personal.', '2003-04-14 23:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(266614, 17986, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great macro of these.  The sugar flakes on the table add a lot to this.</td>', 'Great macro of these.  The sugar flakes on the table add a lot to this.', '2003-04-14 23:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(266615, 18278, 5767, '<td valign="top">Ha Ha Ha.  Fun.</td>', 'Ha Ha Ha.  Fun.', '2003-04-14 23:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(266617, 18217, 5767, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2003-04-14 23:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(266619, 18211, 5767, '<td valign="top">Very creative.</td>', 'Very creative.', '2003-04-14 23:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(266622, 18085, 5767, '<td valign="top">If you could have this every night for dinner. Yum.  Maybe a little over exposed, though.  I like the composition and everything else about it, though.</td>', 'If you could have this every night for dinner. Yum.  Maybe a little over exposed, though.  I like the composition and everything else about it, though.', '2003-04-14 23:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(266623, 18080, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great reflection - misty and moody.  Almond on stage.  It has a 1950''s look to it.</td>', 'Great reflection - misty and moody.  Almond on stage.  It has a 1950''s look to it.', '2003-04-14 23:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(266624, 18264, 5767, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a color accent.</td>', 'Nice use of a color accent.', '2003-04-14 23:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(266625, 18214, 5767, '<td valign="top">That one snuck up on you and got caught.  Or is that your way of quitting?</td>', 'That one snuck up on you and got caught.  Or is that your way of quitting?', '2003-04-14 23:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(266627, 18231, 5767, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  Nice lines to follow around.  Good exposure - it''s in focus.  Well done.</td>', 'I like this one.  Nice lines to follow around.  Good exposure - it''s in focus.  Well done.', '2003-04-14 23:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(266628, 18270, 5767, '<td valign="top">Good use of lighting and your color selection is beautiful.</td>', 'Good use of lighting and your color selection is beautiful.', '2003-04-14 23:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(266630, 18129, 5767, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  I can''t look at it for too long, but it''s beautiful.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  I can''t look at it for too long, but it''s beautiful.', '2003-04-14 23:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(266666, 18129, 7838, '<td valign="top">strangely odd.  not sure how to take this picture. i don''t know how you did it, definitely interesting. but throws my vision off (probably what you wanted).  good colors, i like the color pattern. just the way it is focused.... not to sure about it.  i''ll give you an A for effort.</td>', 'strangely odd.  not sure how to take this picture. i don''t know how you did it, definitely interesting. but throws my vision off (probably what you wanted).  good colors, i like the color pattern. just the way it is focused.... not to sure about it.  i''ll give you an A for effort.', '2003-04-15 00:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(266669, 17650, 6900, '<td valign="top">A good shot, even without the cat, but the inclusion makes me love this photo.  Definitely one of the best candy shots!  Congrats.</td>', 'A good shot, even without the cat, but the inclusion makes me love this photo.  Definitely one of the best candy shots!  Congrats.', '2003-04-15 00:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(266671, 18164, 6900, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting.  I think I would have taken the silver wrapper out and fake-wrapped it.  The ring has a nasty reflection, but otherwise superb shot and pose.</td>', 'Love the lighting.  I think I would have taken the silver wrapper out and fake-wrapped it.  The ring has a nasty reflection, but otherwise superb shot and pose.', '2003-04-15 00:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(266673, 18251, 6900, '<td valign="top">A total classic.  I like the pez'' lying around.</td>', 'A total classic.  I like the pez'' lying around.', '2003-04-15 00:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(266676, 18105, 6900, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the white "Where''s Waldo" shot.  Interesting exposure!  Definitely creative - I like it.</td>', 'Reminds me of the white "Where''s Waldo" shot.  Interesting exposure!  Definitely creative - I like it.', '2003-04-15 00:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(266678, 18097, 6900, '<td valign="top">Strange color scheme going on!  I like it (would have preferred it last week because the first thing in my mind is "COLOR!"  Great job.</td>', 'Strange color scheme going on!  I like it (would have preferred it last week because the first thing in my mind is "COLOR!"  Great job.', '2003-04-15 00:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(266692, 18098, 7838, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting and good detail.  good thing i just finished eating, otherwise i would make an unnecessary trip to the fridge.  the wrapper adds a little color to the picture, but i would like to see a bit more of the design.  I bet that first bite was good, too.  i see your teeth marks in the right bottom of the bar.  I personally thinks that detracts from the whole scene, but on quick glance, i didn''t see it.  i still rate it pretty high.</td>', 'very nice lighting and good detail.  good thing i just finished eating, otherwise i would make an unnecessary trip to the fridge.  the wrapper adds a little color to the picture, but i would like to see a bit more of the design.  I bet that first bite was good, too.  i see your teeth marks in the right bottom of the bar.  I personally thinks that detracts from the whole scene, but on quick glance, i didn''t see it.  i still rate it pretty high.', '2003-04-15 00:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(266696, 18031, 7838, '<td valign="top">pez and nerds.. you do have a sweet tooth. i just wish you included a nerds box as well.  good shot otherwise</td>', 'pez and nerds.. you do have a sweet tooth. i just wish you included a nerds box as well.  good shot otherwise', '2003-04-15 00:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(266712, 18278, 7838, '<td valign="top">i wish the cans were a little more colorful.  i didn''t notice the worm right away.  had to really look at it.  definitely a nice pun.</td>', 'i wish the cans were a little more colorful.  i didn''t notice the worm right away.  had to really look at it.  definitely a nice pun.', '2003-04-15 00:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(266717, 18123, 7838, '<td valign="top">very nice way to throw me off.  at first i saw the extra orange m&amp;m.  then i saw the skittle.  very nice, not to happy with the orange color.  looks very grainy, that is what brought my score down</td>', 'very nice way to throw me off.  at first i saw the extra orange m&m.  then i saw the skittle.  very nice, not to happy with the orange color.  looks very grainy, that is what brought my score down', '2003-04-15 00:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(266723, 17843, 7838, '<td valign="top">interesting piece. background should be a little less wrinkled, candy a little more in focus, but hand looks great.</td>', 'interesting piece. background should be a little less wrinkled, candy a little more in focus, but hand looks great.', '2003-04-15 00:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(266726, 18266, 7838, '<td valign="top">nice texture. i think lighting would have been better from the 7:00 position.</td>', 'nice texture. i think lighting would have been better from the 7:00 position.', '2003-04-15 00:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(266733, 17916, 7838, '<td valign="top">nice. i like the reflection in the foreground. but i think you took it "out of focus" a bit too soon.  I want to know what was in the back ground or at least have an idea.</td>', 'nice. i like the reflection in the foreground. but i think you took it "out of focus" a bit too soon.  I want to know what was in the back ground or at least have an idea.', '2003-04-15 00:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(266739, 17706, 7838, '<td valign="top">i really like the reflection effect.  nice comp.</td>', 'i really like the reflection effect.  nice comp.', '2003-04-15 00:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(266747, 18085, 7838, '<td valign="top">clashes a bit, doesn''t it. not color, but subjects.  if only this were good for you - you would have a best seller.</td>', 'clashes a bit, doesn''t it. not color, but subjects.  if only this were good for you - you would have a best seller.', '2003-04-15 00:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(266751, 18125, 7838, '<td valign="top">nice title. i like the mirror shot.  if only it really worked this way to double you money.......</td>', 'nice title. i like the mirror shot.  if only it really worked this way to double you money.......', '2003-04-15 00:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(266753, 18262, 7838, '<td valign="top">how????????????????????????????</td>', 'how????????????????????????????', '2003-04-15 00:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(266754, 18224, 7838, '<td valign="top">give me a break!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!1  nice shot. i think the crumbs add a lot to it.  nice reflection and good lighting.</td>', 'give me a break!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!1  nice shot. i think the crumbs add a lot to it.  nice reflection and good lighting.', '2003-04-15 00:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(266755, 18245, 7838, '<td valign="top">i see the camera and you. otherwise nice.</td>', 'i see the camera and you. otherwise nice.', '2003-04-15 00:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(266756, 18146, 7838, '<td valign="top">too bad real candy doesn''t taste like that.</td>', 'too bad real candy doesn''t taste like that.', '2003-04-15 00:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(266759, 17951, 7838, '<td valign="top">very nice. lady and the tramp... i like</td>', 'very nice. lady and the tramp... i like', '2003-04-15 00:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(266767, 18258, 1280, '<td valign="top">Cute! Made me smile...good sense of humour!!!</td>', 'Cute! Made me smile...good sense of humour!!!', '2003-04-15 00:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(266771, 17948, 1280, '<td valign="top">The subject is good, but I think you could have used a more attractive setting...a nice dish instead of aluminum, for example.</td>', 'The subject is good, but I think you could have used a more attractive setting...a nice dish instead of aluminum, for example.', '2003-04-15 00:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(266784, 18165, 1280, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen anything quite like it.  Looks yummy.  Interesting texture and lighting. I like it!</td>', 'I''ve never seen anything quite like it.  Looks yummy.  Interesting texture and lighting. I like it!', '2003-04-15 01:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(266785, 18164, 3607, '<td valign="top">yummy!</td>', 'yummy!', '2003-04-15 01:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(266788, 18217, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice colouring but would be nicer without the wrapper.</td>', 'Nice colouring but would be nicer without the wrapper.', '2003-04-15 01:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(266792, 18249, 3607, '<td valign="top">very good shot of the candy, but the background - i wish it had a bit less texture/shadows to not distract from the subject of the photo.</td>', 'very good shot of the candy, but the background - i wish it had a bit less texture/shadows to not distract from the subject of the photo.', '2003-04-15 01:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(266794, 18080, 7838, '<td valign="top">very nice shot.  i like the slight reflection, the gold tone to the entire pic. very nice.</td>', 'very nice shot.  i like the slight reflection, the gold tone to the entire pic. very nice.', '2003-04-15 01:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(266797, 18274, 3607, '<td valign="top">a little over exposed.  a boost in the post processing saturation would have mayble helped in bringing out the colors a little more.</td>', 'a little over exposed.  a boost in the post processing saturation would have mayble helped in bringing out the colors a little more.', '2003-04-15 01:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(266798, 18075, 7838, '<td valign="top">did it just happen this way, or is the a reversed (flipped side to side) shot.  looks like the old film-based reverse negative.</td>', 'did it just happen this way, or is the a reversed (flipped side to side) shot.  looks like the old film-based reverse negative.', '2003-04-15 01:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(266803, 18212, 7838, '<td valign="top">i think you could have cropped out the black top corners.and i don''t like the lid for a base.  great idea with size representation.</td>', 'i think you could have cropped out the black top corners.and i don''t like the lid for a base.  great idea with size representation.', '2003-04-15 01:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(266806, 18127, 3607, '<td valign="top">why have the hand in the photo.  why not have jay and some candy in a photo, with a blank background where jay and the candy would really stand out together?  is the red stuff in his mouth candy (are we supposed to figure this out?).  its a great shot of jay.  the hand, and the lack of obvious candy (bitten or unbitten) supply weakens it.</td>', 'why have the hand in the photo.  why not have jay and some candy in a photo, with a blank background where jay and the candy would really stand out together?  is the red stuff in his mouth candy (are we supposed to figure this out?).  its a great shot of jay.  the hand, and the lack of obvious candy (bitten or unbitten) supply weakens it.', '2003-04-15 01:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
