(267858, 18166, 6565, '<td valign="top">I have looked at every single photo here -- I''m a complete candy NUT, but for some reason this photo was the only one that actually made me hungry for candy.  There''s something so inviting about the composition!  I think I''ll hit the grocery store tonight.  Gee, thanks. :)</td>', 'I have looked at every single photo here -- I''m a complete candy NUT, but for some reason this photo was the only one that actually made me hungry for candy.  There''s something so inviting about the composition!  I think I''ll hit the grocery store tonight.  Gee, thanks. :)', '2003-04-15 18:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(267859, 18264, 6565, '<td valign="top">Awwww! :(  Way to capture a mood with inanimate objects!</td>', 'Awwww! :(  Way to capture a mood with inanimate objects!', '2003-04-15 18:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(267860, 18272, 6565, '<td valign="top">I''m reminded of 2001: A Space Odyssey.  In a good way. :)  Good example of symmetry working to your advantage in a composition.</td>', 'I''m reminded of 2001: A Space Odyssey.  In a good way. :)  Good example of symmetry working to your advantage in a composition.', '2003-04-15 18:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(267906, 18262, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really neat idea!  Focus seems strongest on the leading edge of the jar, IMHO it should be on the picture of the lady and the red-hots.  Great color!  I like the framing of this photo.  6 Swash</td>', 'Really neat idea!  Focus seems strongest on the leading edge of the jar, IMHO it should be on the picture of the lady and the red-hots.  Great color!  I like the framing of this photo.  6 Swash', '2003-04-15 19:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(267908, 18146, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s a very clear, colorful image.  Fruit is sweet and a terrific alternative to candy, but it''s not candy.  The strawberries seem a bit old.  6 Swash</td>', 'It''s a very clear, colorful image.  Fruit is sweet and a terrific alternative to candy, but it''s not candy.  The strawberries seem a bit old.  6 Swash', '2003-04-15 19:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
