(267961, 18057, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nicely detailed view of a favorite candy...  good job!</td>', 'Nicely detailed view of a favorite candy...  good job!', '2003-04-15 20:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(267966, 18125, 7350, '<td valign="top">A little dark, but great idea!</td>', 'A little dark, but great idea!', '2003-04-15 20:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(267967, 18273, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very sweet shot!  Num, num.... (Note: bribe subject with candy, got it!) - Nicely done!  [Possible critique: Centering the shot (moving to your left), might have improved the shot by squaring it up.]</td>', 'Very sweet shot!  Num, num.... (Note: bribe subject with candy, got it!) - Nicely done!  [Possible critique: Centering the shot (moving to your left), might have improved the shot by squaring it up.]', '2003-04-15 20:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(267968, 17980, 1005, '<td valign="top">The central part of this photo is in good focus, but the twisty parts seem out.  Lots of negative space.  Technically, this is a candy-ish cough drop, isn''t it?  Wouldn''t this be medicine?  (more than candy?)  Was the pinkish hue of the lighting on purpose?  (It sort of goes with the subject, but puzzles me a bit)  6 Swash</td>', 'The central part of this photo is in good focus, but the twisty parts seem out.  Lots of negative space.  Technically, this is a candy-ish cough drop, isn''t it?  Wouldn''t this be medicine?  (more than candy?)  Was the pinkish hue of the lighting on purpose?  (It sort of goes with the subject, but puzzles me a bit)  6 Swash', '2003-04-15 20:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(267969, 18251, 5826, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, 10.</td>', 'Brilliant, 10.', '2003-04-15 20:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(267974, 18077, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very bright, colorful image!  Focus seems strongest on the light blue stick, with weaker focus on the other colors.  These look very interesting, maybe a macro of just one might have worked easier.  Took me a while to figure out that the wooden pieces went with the candy.  6 Swash</td>', 'Very bright, colorful image!  Focus seems strongest on the light blue stick, with weaker focus on the other colors.  These look very interesting, maybe a macro of just one might have worked easier.  Took me a while to figure out that the wooden pieces went with the candy.  6 Swash', '2003-04-15 20:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(267976, 18212, 1005, '<td valign="top">Humourous idea!  Focus on the candy bar is very strong.  Glare on the "BIG" is extremely harsh.  The "viewers" are a cute touch.  6 Swash</td>', 'Humourous idea!  Focus on the candy bar is very strong.  Glare on the "BIG" is extremely harsh.  The "viewers" are a cute touch.  6 Swash', '2003-04-15 20:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(267979, 18153, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice models!  You got the title right.  Very well focused shot with excellent color.  Challenge-wise - it''s a stretch, a looonnggg stretch.  As a beer or bikini ad, this would be a great shot.  Best I can go on this challenge is a 6.  Swash</td>', 'Nice models!  You got the title right.  Very well focused shot with excellent color.  Challenge-wise - it''s a stretch, a looonnggg stretch.  As a beer or bikini ad, this would be a great shot.  Best I can go on this challenge is a 6.  Swash', '2003-04-15 20:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(267981, 18278, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, good pun, but it did take me more than a minute to "get" this one.  Sharp focus.  Crop - I''d rather see more chopped off the bottom.  Challenge - O.K., but if I have to think hard to get the challenge, it might be a bit of a reach.  7 Swash</td>', 'Cute idea, good pun, but it did take me more than a minute to "get" this one.  Sharp focus.  Crop - I''d rather see more chopped off the bottom.  Challenge - O.K., but if I have to think hard to get the challenge, it might be a bit of a reach.  7 Swash', '2003-04-15 20:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(267982, 18264, 6600, '<td valign="top">Creative title and idea! Composition works well, nicely focused.  Good job!</td>', 'Creative title and idea! Composition works well, nicely focused.  Good job!', '2003-04-15 20:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
