(268577, 18214, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute shot!  Made me laugh.  The trap looks great, the bait is wonderful and tempting, the goo under the trap with the "chips" in it, less than appealing.  Focus is great!!!  Color - top notch.  I''m not going to stress over the goo...9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cute shot!  Made me laugh.  The trap looks great, the bait is wonderful and tempting, the goo under the trap with the "chips" in it, less than appealing.  Focus is great!!!  Color - top notch.  I''m not going to stress over the goo...9 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-16 13:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(268579, 17706, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  I like your turn of the canvas, really works well!  Focus, color and framing - all top notch.  The reflection of the lipstick o the candy is great.  I can''t put my finger on it, but something in the back of my head says something is wrong....(maybe it''s just the turn of the canvas?)  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nicely done!  I like your turn of the canvas, really works well!  Focus, color and framing - all top notch.  The reflection of the lipstick o the candy is great.  I can''t put my finger on it, but something in the back of my head says something is wrong....(maybe it''s just the turn of the canvas?)  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-16 13:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(268581, 18231, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I can''t really say why this appeals to me so much, but it does.  Love the color!  Glare is present, but not a huge problem.  Good color and texture.  Focus seems really, really good.  (True nit:  the 4 small hot spots in the yellow, sort in the lower right corner are a tad hot, but not worth nicking any points)  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice shot!  I can''t really say why this appeals to me so much, but it does.  Love the color!  Glare is present, but not a huge problem.  Good color and texture.  Focus seems really, really good.  (True nit:  the 4 small hot spots in the yellow, sort in the lower right corner are a tad hot, but not worth nicking any points)  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-16 13:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(268583, 18199, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Very sharp focus, good color and a nice of negative space, but I\''m not liking your choice of background colors.  It seems to stark against these very bright colors (is there such a thing as too much contrast?)  I like the shadows cast by the glass pieces, wouldn\''t mind seeing more of them.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cute idea.  Very sharp focus, good color and a nice of negative space, but I\''m not liking your choice of background colors.  It seems to stark against these very bright colors (is there such a thing as too much contrast?)  I like the shadows cast by the glass pieces, wouldn\''t mind seeing more of them.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-16 13:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(268584, 18272, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo.  To me, the glare in the middle and the shadows around the edges are too contradictory/harsh amount of change.  Nit-picky - the raised edges around the word HERSHEY''S has been "roughed up", a "cleaner" bar would have been slightly more appealing.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very sharp photo.  To me, the glare in the middle and the shadows around the edges are too contradictory/harsh amount of change.  Nit-picky - the raised edges around the word HERSHEY''S has been "roughed up", a "cleaner" bar would have been slightly more appealing.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-16 13:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(268586, 17948, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Mostly sharp with good color.  Reflections in the glass and some "extra" background take away a little of the appeal.  White parts of candy have a sort of "color" pattern in them.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice shot.  Mostly sharp with good color.  Reflections in the glass and some "extra" background take away a little of the appeal.  White parts of candy have a sort of "color" pattern in them.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-16 13:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(268590, 17922, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear photo.  Perhaps a little tightly cropped.  The glare on the wrapper is on the harsher side (but it almost makes a smiley face, ask me, I''ll point it out).  Color seems pretty good.  7 Swash</td>', 'Very clear photo.  Perhaps a little tightly cropped.  The glare on the wrapper is on the harsher side (but it almost makes a smiley face, ask me, I''ll point it out).  Color seems pretty good.  7 Swash', '2003-04-16 13:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(268591, 17843, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a really great idea!  It''s too bright, the hand is almost washed out and has some grain (look at the thumb-nail).  Most of the candy''s motion stopped, this is both good and bad - shows motion (good), some look blurred our almost "added" (not accusing you of cheating in any way).  More candy might have been good.<br/>7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'This is a really great idea!  It''s too bright, the hand is almost washed out and has some grain (look at the thumb-nail).  Most of the candy''s motion stopped, this is both good and bad - shows motion (good), some look blurred our almost "added" (not accusing you of cheating in any way).  More candy might have been good.7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-16 13:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(268594, 18208, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good, clear photo.  Nice cross lighting.  I''m sorry, but I don''t quite think of ice cream as candy, yes, it''s a sugary desert, but not quite candy (but I''m not going to chop off your points due to a difference of "opinion").  I like the idea of the spoon, but not really at this acute of an angle.  I think I would have liked the stronger light on the side of the lid, rather than the opposite (makes for better "ad" copy).  <br/>7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Good, clear photo.  Nice cross lighting.  I''m sorry, but I don''t quite think of ice cream as candy, yes, it''s a sugary desert, but not quite candy (but I''m not going to chop off your points due to a difference of "opinion").  I like the idea of the spoon, but not really at this acute of an angle.  I think I would have liked the stronger light on the side of the lid, rather than the opposite (makes for better "ad" copy).  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-16 13:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(268595, 18178, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot.. i like the way the red really stands out strongly here... nice work :) - setzer</td>', 'excellent shot.. i like the way the red really stands out strongly here... nice work :) - setzer', '2003-04-16 13:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(268596, 18096, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very bright shot!  Lots of great color.  Focus seems strong, but should be as the subjects are very parallel to each other and the camera.  I''m not sure white would be the "best" background (esp. for the whiter candies).  In general, pretty but unpatterned (maybe make a tic-tac-toe game of it?).   7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very bright shot!  Lots of great color.  Focus seems strong, but should be as the subjects are very parallel to each other and the camera.  I''m not sure white would be the "best" background (esp. for the whiter candies).  In general, pretty but unpatterned (maybe make a tic-tac-toe game of it?).   7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-16 14:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(268599, 17940, 1005, '<td valign="top">Clear shot, interesting effect.  Now, think about this...chromed candy?  Takes away a bit of the yummy appeal, don''t you think?  Crop - too tight, if you''re going to crop off parts of the jar, crop with a purpose, this just nicks the jar in several places.  Maybe use "chrome effect" in a different challenge?  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Clear shot, interesting effect.  Now, think about this...chromed candy?  Takes away a bit of the yummy appeal, don''t you think?  Crop - too tight, if you''re going to crop off parts of the jar, crop with a purpose, this just nicks the jar in several places.  Maybe use "chrome effect" in a different challenge?  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-16 14:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(268601, 17904, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very colorful!  Focus seems very sharp, esp. on the back row.  Foreground, to me, overwhelms the "busy", on the other hand, the tubes in the back row are catching quite a bit of glare (so I wouldn''t suggest just centering on them, but I did consider this).  The store''s bulk bagging might have been good to avoid, too. <br/>7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very colorful!  Focus seems very sharp, esp. on the back row.  Foreground, to me, overwhelms the "busy", on the other hand, the tubes in the back row are catching quite a bit of glare (so I wouldn''t suggest just centering on them, but I did consider this).  The store''s bulk bagging might have been good to avoid, too. 7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-16 14:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
