(268673, 18273, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I don''t think you needed the top of the fence though.  The  part of sky and tree peeking through draws the eye up and away from the subject.  The subject is wonderful and the background works well.</td>', 'I like this.  I don''t think you needed the top of the fence though.  The  part of sky and tree peeking through draws the eye up and away from the subject.  The subject is wonderful and the background works well.', '2003-04-16 16:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
