(268805, 18123, 811, '<td valign="top">Great work.  Took me a second to find it.  The lighting is just a touch harsh,but the colors and focus are wonderful.</td>', 'Great work.  Took me a second to find it.  The lighting is just a touch harsh,but the colors and focus are wonderful.', '2003-04-16 19:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(268806, 18231, 811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus and colors!</td>', 'Wonderful focus and colors!', '2003-04-16 19:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(268807, 18062, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the richeness of the colors.  Also, the angle that you have shot it with, and your composition is also very good.  Just a note, and it has nothing to do with your score, but the border seems a bit wide and intrusive to me.</td>', 'I like the richeness of the colors.  Also, the angle that you have shot it with, and your composition is also very good.  Just a note, and it has nothing to do with your score, but the border seems a bit wide and intrusive to me.', '2003-04-16 19:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(268808, 18211, 811, '<td valign="top">The reflection really adds to this!!!!  Great work -- focus and lighting are awesome.  Well done</td>', 'The reflection really adds to this!!!!  Great work -- focus and lighting are awesome.  Well done', '2003-04-16 19:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(268809, 18137, 811, '<td valign="top">The focus and lighting works well here, but after looking at it on three different monitors, the orange tictacs look almost like the cinnamon ones.   I would almost bet that you have a Sony camera, because both of my Sony''s do the same thing(reds and oranges are crazy sometimes).  Maybe the green ones would have done better.  having said all that, the composition is right on, and I really like this shot.</td>', 'The focus and lighting works well here, but after looking at it on three different monitors, the orange tictacs look almost like the cinnamon ones.   I would almost bet that you have a Sony camera, because both of my Sony''s do the same thing(reds and oranges are crazy sometimes).  Maybe the green ones would have done better.  having said all that, the composition is right on, and I really like this shot.', '2003-04-16 19:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(268810, 18088, 811, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge, and an excellent shot (focus, lighting, etc&gt;)</td>', 'Great take on the challenge, and an excellent shot (focus, lighting, etc>)', '2003-04-16 19:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(268811, 18105, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the white on white, but it does seem to need something to give it a little more *pop*.  Maybe a touch more contrast?</td>', 'I love the white on white, but it does seem to need something to give it a little more *pop*.  Maybe a touch more contrast?', '2003-04-16 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(268812, 18029, 811, '<td valign="top">The entire picture seems a little grainy to me, but great colors and set up.  I like how they "scatter" at the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'The entire picture seems a little grainy to me, but great colors and set up.  I like how they "scatter" at the bottom of the frame.', '2003-04-16 19:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(268813, 18217, 811, '<td valign="top">Great colors, focus, and lighting.  The red really contrasts nicely with the blue background.  I am sure you have a reason for leaving the wrapper on, but I think it would have made a better picture without it.</td>', 'Great colors, focus, and lighting.  The red really contrasts nicely with the blue background.  I am sure you have a reason for leaving the wrapper on, but I think it would have made a better picture without it.', '2003-04-16 19:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(268814, 18273, 811, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I am sure he hated posing for this one!  haha.  Two things, the straight on angle makes the shot appear flat, though it is a good way to get a profile.  I think a lower, more frontal angle showing more of his face would have been effective.  It might have also correct the slight tilt the picture seems to have.  The second thing is that the colors are a bit flat.  Maybe a touch of saturation or brightness/contrast would help.  Good work.</td>', 'Great capture.  I am sure he hated posing for this one!  haha.  Two things, the straight on angle makes the shot appear flat, though it is a good way to get a profile.  I think a lower, more frontal angle showing more of his face would have been effective.  It might have also correct the slight tilt the picture seems to have.  The second thing is that the colors are a bit flat.  Maybe a touch of saturation or brightness/contrast would help.  Good work.', '2003-04-16 19:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(268816, 18129, 811, '<td valign="top">Great effect.  Very well done<br/></td>', 'Great effect.  Very well done', '2003-04-16 19:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(268817, 17650, 811, '<td valign="top">The cat looks totally bewildered!  Great capture!  The yellow ones are a bit bright, though, to me.</td>', 'The cat looks totally bewildered!  Great capture!  The yellow ones are a bit bright, though, to me.', '2003-04-16 19:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(268818, 18144, 811, '<td valign="top">Great focus and colors.  I like the crop here.</td>', 'Great focus and colors.  I like the crop here.', '2003-04-16 19:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(268819, 17986, 811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro.  Very good focus.</td>', 'Wonderful macro.  Very good focus.', '2003-04-16 19:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(268820, 18278, 811, '<td valign="top">Great use of humor!!!!  I like the worm at the top of the can, though I now see a second one at the base.  Trying to escape, huh?</td>', 'Great use of humor!!!!  I like the worm at the top of the can, though I now see a second one at the base.  Trying to escape, huh?', '2003-04-16 19:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
