(269339, 18129, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! I sure am envious you can do double negative exposures, my camera can''t do that. At least you make full  use of that function, clever!</td>', 'Excellent shot! I sure am envious you can do double negative exposures, my camera can''t do that. At least you make full  use of that function, clever!', '2003-04-17 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
