(269344, 18272, 3669, '<td valign="top">The color just seems off here....maybe too dark?  The chocolate kind of looks like its been out too long and is dried out.  Not very appealing.  Otherwise, it is a very good idea.  I love Hershey bars.  Good DOF.</td>', 'The color just seems off here....maybe too dark?  The chocolate kind of looks like its been out too long and is dried out.  Not very appealing.  Otherwise, it is a very good idea.  I love Hershey bars.  Good DOF.', '2003-04-17 09:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(269346, 18264, 3669, '<td valign="top">The shine and soft focus of what I believe to be a bowl of lemon sour balls made them look wet, gooey and stuck together.  Other than that, I really like this shot.  Appears to show a mood with the simple use of candy.  You had a really good idea in using the "intruder".  The border is nice too.  It pulls in the yellow color, making the red loner even more out of place.</td>', 'The shine and soft focus of what I believe to be a bowl of lemon sour balls made them look wet, gooey and stuck together.  Other than that, I really like this shot.  Appears to show a mood with the simple use of candy.  You had a really good idea in using the "intruder".  The border is nice too.  It pulls in the yellow color, making the red loner even more out of place.', '2003-04-17 09:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(269347, 18029, 4517, '<td valign="top">So how long did that take to do? Shame there so fuzzy, or maybe this was deliberate or to much sharpening. I feel this could have been so much better.</td>', 'So how long did that take to do? Shame there so fuzzy, or maybe this was deliberate or to much sharpening. I feel this could have been so much better.', '2003-04-17 09:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(269348, 18184, 3669, '<td valign="top">Even though I don''t happen to like this particuliar kind of candy, they made for a nice colorful shot.  However, they appear to be a little flat...maybe with a little more adjustment to the color balance, it would bring out the colors a little better.  Otherwise, your focus and lighting are great and definately meets the challenge.</td>', 'Even though I don''t happen to like this particuliar kind of candy, they made for a nice colorful shot.  However, they appear to be a little flat...maybe with a little more adjustment to the color balance, it would bring out the colors a little better.  Otherwise, your focus and lighting are great and definately meets the challenge.', '2003-04-17 10:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(269351, 17951, 2130, '<td valign="top">blue ribbon, exelent shot!!</td>', 'blue ribbon, exelent shot!!', '2003-04-17 10:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(269355, 18180, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is really an abstract meaning to the "candy" challenge, but good idea anyway. I wish the bee wasn''t so centered though, it would have been better if you''d followed the rule of thirds and placed it further towards one of the corners.</td>', 'Now this is really an abstract meaning to the "candy" challenge, but good idea anyway. I wish the bee wasn''t so centered though, it would have been better if you''d followed the rule of thirds and placed it further towards one of the corners.', '2003-04-17 11:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(269357, 18212, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting set-up, good luck!</td>', 'Interesting set-up, good luck!', '2003-04-17 11:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(269359, 18119, 5728, '<td valign="top">The focus is a little too soft and I''m not sure about the background. It ''s a little loud, but the idea is good, good luck.</td>', 'The focus is a little too soft and I''m not sure about the background. It ''s a little loud, but the idea is good, good luck.', '2003-04-17 11:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(269360, 17922, 5728, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit too glarey on the plastic wrapping, but other than that good idea.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit too glarey on the plastic wrapping, but other than that good idea.', '2003-04-17 11:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(269361, 17940, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow, psychodelic! The orange and blue match, and the lighting is good.</td>', 'Wow, psychodelic! The orange and blue match, and the lighting is good.', '2003-04-17 11:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(269362, 18153, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very inviting!!!! The title fits!</td>', 'Very inviting!!!! The title fits!', '2003-04-17 11:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(269363, 18046, 5728, '<td valign="top">The border is way overexaggerated! It takes all the focus away from the main subject.</td>', 'The border is way overexaggerated! It takes all the focus away from the main subject.', '2003-04-17 11:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(269364, 18243, 5728, '<td valign="top">I get toothache just looking at this :-) The angles work well here.</td>', 'I get toothache just looking at this :-) The angles work well here.', '2003-04-17 11:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(269365, 18245, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ohhh the reflection in the bottom right corner doesn''t do this image any justice, and your reflection can be seen too. I would have gone more to the left so that the blue in the top right corner wasn''t visible, or maybe cropped it out completely. Otherwise very colorful.</td>', 'Ohhh the reflection in the bottom right corner doesn''t do this image any justice, and your reflection can be seen too. I would have gone more to the left so that the blue in the top right corner wasn''t visible, or maybe cropped it out completely. Otherwise very colorful.', '2003-04-17 11:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(269366, 18262, 5728, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. However the main focal point is on the glass jar closest to the camera. Everything else is unsharp. A smaller aperture may have taken care of this.</td>', 'Clever idea. However the main focal point is on the glass jar closest to the camera. Everything else is unsharp. A smaller aperture may have taken care of this.', '2003-04-17 11:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(269367, 17616, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow colorful, but loud! The focus is also a tad out. Did you eat all this?</td>', 'Wow colorful, but loud! The focus is also a tad out. Did you eat all this?', '2003-04-17 11:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(269368, 17917, 5728, '<td valign="top">Poor doggie! I feel the saturation needs to be tweaked up a little here to bring those colors out more.</td>', 'Poor doggie! I feel the saturation needs to be tweaked up a little here to bring those colors out more.', '2003-04-17 11:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
