(269409, 18109, 772, '<td valign="top">good composition and nice color... the detail on the ''glass'' seems to be a little weak.. - setzler</td>', 'good composition and nice color... the detail on the ''glass'' seems to be a little weak.. - setzler', '2003-04-17 13:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
