(269451, 18137, 1005, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit like an advertisement.  It''s pretty well done, but you might want to try opposing lighting (so the lid isn''t silhouetted) and a tad softer lighting (looks like the same window I used...)  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'This looks a bit like an advertisement.  It''s pretty well done, but you might want to try opposing lighting (so the lid isn''t silhouetted) and a tad softer lighting (looks like the same window I used...)  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 14:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(269453, 17916, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus and color on the front most piece.  (Too bad it took a couple of "hits")  I''m O.K. with the second piece being further behind and out of focus, but I think I see a third piece (or is that a shadow?) that I just don''t care for.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nice focus and color on the front most piece.  (Too bad it took a couple of "hits")  I''m O.K. with the second piece being further behind and out of focus, but I think I see a third piece (or is that a shadow?) that I just don''t care for.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 14:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(269468, 17797, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s very bright and colorful!  I honestly don''t get the title at all.  Focus seems just a bit off, the crystals lack detail.  The color in the upper right area seems overly saturated (blends together), but that may just be an optical illusion created by the layers of the candy bits.  Sorry, but I''ve talked myself into a bit lower score.  From 7 to 6.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'It''s very bright and colorful!  I honestly don''t get the title at all.  Focus seems just a bit off, the crystals lack detail.  The color in the upper right area seems overly saturated (blends together), but that may just be an optical illusion created by the layers of the candy bits.  Sorry, but I''ve talked myself into a bit lower score.  From 7 to 6.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 14:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(269483, 18013, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool idea!  Very different/creative.  To me, it seems like there''s too much negative space between the candy and the sun.  I am impressed with the nearly complete lack of solar flares (I find only one, my lens creates several if I get even close to the sun)  I''d also like the candy bowl just a little larger in the frame.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cool idea!  Very different/creative.  To me, it seems like there''s too much negative space between the candy and the sun.  I am impressed with the nearly complete lack of solar flares (I find only one, my lens creates several if I get even close to the sun)  I''d also like the candy bowl just a little larger in the frame.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 14:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(269503, 18274, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well done photo, has a sort of "ad" feel.  The white background doesn''t contrast well with the light colored candy and half white stix, maybe black would have been better.  Good focus, well set up.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Well done photo, has a sort of "ad" feel.  The white background doesn''t contrast well with the light colored candy and half white stix, maybe black would have been better.  Good focus, well set up.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 14:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(269534, 18088, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice set up, extremely good focus.  I sort of question the black and white, but the title explains that pretty well (color just appeals to me more strongly).  Constrast levels seem pretty good.  Cropping - can''t argue with that either.  I''m going to raise your score from 7 to 8.  It''s too well done for a 7 and my bias shouldn''t hurt your overall score.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice set up, extremely good focus.  I sort of question the black and white, but the title explains that pretty well (color just appeals to me more strongly).  Constrast levels seem pretty good.  Cropping - can''t argue with that either.  I''m going to raise your score from 7 to 8.  It''s too well done for a 7 and my bias shouldn''t hurt your overall score.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 14:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(269545, 18264, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really neat idea!  The yellow candies are very bright (so much so that it''s a bit hard to find their edges, a tad darker might have helped).  My eyes keep being drawn to the little red guy (nice job!).  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Really neat idea!  The yellow candies are very bright (so much so that it''s a bit hard to find their edges, a tad darker might have helped).  My eyes keep being drawn to the little red guy (nice job!).  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 14:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(269550, 18217, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo.  Interesting lighting, but a little bright for the plastic.  I didn''t notice the title (I thought it said Lolly Pop the first viewing), I like the reference, but it might have worked a little better w/o the wrapping.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very sharp photo.  Interesting lighting, but a little bright for the plastic.  I didn''t notice the title (I thought it said Lolly Pop the first viewing), I like the reference, but it might have worked a little better w/o the wrapping.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 14:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(269562, 18166, 1005, '<td valign="top">The green candy is very sharp.  Good color.  The angle makes adds interest, but less great as an "ad" copy (companies want their product name easily read).  The backgrond looks like a paper  towel (eh, not really great) and in the upper right corner is way blown.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'The green candy is very sharp.  Good color.  The angle makes adds interest, but less great as an "ad" copy (companies want their product name easily read).  The backgrond looks like a paper  towel (eh, not really great) and in the upper right corner is way blown.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 14:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(269583, 18245, 1005, '<td valign="top">The gumball machine is colorful and in good focus.  The reflection doesn''t seem to add to the shot (you''re wearing a read jacket, right?)  The candy colors also reflect back into the glass, creating ghost images (not good).  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'The gumball machine is colorful and in good focus.  The reflection doesn''t seem to add to the shot (you''re wearing a read jacket, right?)  The candy colors also reflect back into the glass, creating ghost images (not good).  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 14:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(269599, 18093, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear shot.  Is an alki-selzer needed here?  Not fully fond of the background, it isn''t a very strong contrast, plus it looks like candy was dragged across it?  I like the silver bowl, was it being tipped to further demonstrate the gluttony here?  <br/>7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very clear shot.  Is an alki-selzer needed here?  Not fully fond of the background, it isn''t a very strong contrast, plus it looks like candy was dragged across it?  I like the silver bowl, was it being tipped to further demonstrate the gluttony here?  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 14:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(269617, 18138, 1005, '<td valign="top">Yin/Yang - nice angle of attach for the photo/heavily limits the focal frame.  I like the middle section, very appealing - but since all this "stuff" comes from the same box - I get the feeling you''re trying to "hide" something with this focus limitation.  Color is great!  Unique view of the challenge topic.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Yin/Yang - nice angle of attach for the photo/heavily limits the focal frame.  I like the middle section, very appealing - but since all this "stuff" comes from the same box - I get the feeling you''re trying to "hide" something with this focus limitation.  Color is great!  Unique view of the challenge topic.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(269624, 18085, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, did the "kids" "buy it"?  The lettuce seems a little too bright, hard to see it''s details (more contrast).  Focus is good.  Color seems really nice.  Glare is the worst on the left lower lettuce leaf, but not bad on the candies.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Interesting idea, did the "kids" "buy it"?  The lettuce seems a little too bright, hard to see it''s details (more contrast).  Focus is good.  Color seems really nice.  Glare is the worst on the left lower lettuce leaf, but not bad on the candies.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(269630, 18273, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  I like it better w/o the sky/top of the fence.  Focus seems a tad off on the boy (more sharp on the chair back).  Contrast is a little low, too.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cute shot.  I like it better w/o the sky/top of the fence.  Focus seems a tad off on the boy (more sharp on the chair back).  Contrast is a little low, too.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(269646, 18180, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really neat shot!  It''s a pretty long stretch for the challenge (maybe too creative of an idea for this challenge).  On the other hand, I like bee shots and this is a pretty good one.  I scored you down a bit for the challenge aspect, but this morning...I''m feeling more generous.  Score raised from 7 to 8.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Really neat shot!  It''s a pretty long stretch for the challenge (maybe too creative of an idea for this challenge).  On the other hand, I like bee shots and this is a pretty good one.  I scored you down a bit for the challenge aspect, but this morning...I''m feeling more generous.  Score raised from 7 to 8.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(269648, 18164, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear shot, color is very nice.  (She kinda looks like she''s going to kiss the bar?)  The hand is a tad over exposed, looks like the camera''s flash (I rarely use it).  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very clear shot, color is very nice.  (She kinda looks like she''s going to kiss the bar?)  The hand is a tad over exposed, looks like the camera''s flash (I rarely use it).  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(269652, 18080, 1005, '<td valign="top">Looks like a candy ad!  Nice use of rule of thirds.  Well set up (almond flag!).  I see why you used direct lighting (face on), for the good, well aligned reflection, but it does leave some of this little candy "in the dark", no ideas how one might improve that.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Looks like a candy ad!  Nice use of rule of thirds.  Well set up (almond flag!).  I see why you used direct lighting (face on), for the good, well aligned reflection, but it does leave some of this little candy "in the dark", no ideas how one might improve that.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(269653, 18046, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wildly different idea (very creative).  Did the blue one bleed color?  Upper left corner seems viginetted (probably just in the dark).  I just noticed, all the snow has a bit of blue hue to it.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Wildly different idea (very creative).  Did the blue one bleed color?  Upper left corner seems viginetted (probably just in the dark).  I just noticed, all the snow has a bit of blue hue to it.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(269656, 17917, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute shot!  (probably very bad for this old dog)  Good focus.  A touch of glare on the middle wrapper.  A little tighly cropped on the dog''s head. (all pretty minor problems)  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cute shot!  (probably very bad for this old dog)  Good focus.  A touch of glare on the middle wrapper.  A little tighly cropped on the dog''s head. (all pretty minor problems)  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(269657, 18129, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool effect (I hope you left a good description).  Very well laid out (still this trick seems too good to be legal - that''s a compliment). Score raised from 8 to 9.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cool effect (I hope you left a good description).  Very well laid out (still this trick seems too good to be legal - that''s a compliment). Score raised from 8 to 9.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(269660, 18062, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat patterns, very well laid out.  Focus seems perfect.  Color is very nice.  Cropping - (nit time) I would have preferred the two corner oranges to not be "nicked" (very minor).  Lighting seems very good.  Score upgrade from 8 to 9.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Neat patterns, very well laid out.  Focus seems perfect.  Color is very nice.  Cropping - (nit time) I would have preferred the two corner oranges to not be "nicked" (very minor).  Lighting seems very good.  Score upgrade from 8 to 9.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(269662, 18125, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, very well laid out.  I like the partly unwrapped coin, nice touch.  I could wish the chocolate had just a little more light on it.  Focus seems very good.  <br/>8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Neat shot, very well laid out.  I like the partly unwrapped coin, nice touch.  I could wish the chocolate had just a little more light on it.  Focus seems very good.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(269665, 18029, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat idea!  Looks like a lot of work went into this.  The photo seems sharp enough, but something''s wrong (too saturated? a little grainy? Too bright? Pastelized?{I think I just made up that word - has the feel of being made more pastel}  I''m just not sure).  I do like how the patter seems to "die off" in the front.  Sorry, but this clarity issue keeps bothering me, score downgrade from 8 to 7.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Neat idea!  Looks like a lot of work went into this.  The photo seems sharp enough, but something''s wrong (too saturated? a little grainy? Too bright? Pastelized?{I think I just made up that word - has the feel of being made more pastel}  I''m just not sure).  I do like how the patter seems to "die off" in the front.  Sorry, but this clarity issue keeps bothering me, score downgrade from 8 to 7.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(269667, 17951, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sweet, romantic idea!  Contrast with the background seems a little weak, esp. for the woman.  The "pile" of licorice seems over-saturated (less than clear as the rest of the image).  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Sweet, romantic idea!  Contrast with the background seems a little weak, esp. for the woman.  The "pile" of licorice seems over-saturated (less than clear as the rest of the image).  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(269669, 18031, 1005, '<td valign="top">Funny title.  Lots of color!  Focus is very strong, but the whole thing seems to have a "soft focus" haze to it.  It looks a bit jumbled/haphazard.  Lighting seems a little strong (glare on the glazed pieces).  All these critizisms are pretty minor.  Score stays at 8.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Funny title.  Lots of color!  Focus is very strong, but the whole thing seems to have a "soft focus" haze to it.  It looks a bit jumbled/haphazard.  Lighting seems a little strong (glare on the glazed pieces).  All these critizisms are pretty minor.  Score stays at 8.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 15:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(269719, 18127, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute photo!  Wouldn''t the candy be "bad" for Jay?  Very nice detail, the claws on his left hand are very visible.  Color seems pretty good.  Love that head!<br/>8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cute photo!  Wouldn''t the candy be "bad" for Jay?  Very nice detail, the claws on his left hand are very visible.  Color seems pretty good.  Love that head!8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 16:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
