(269737, 17948, 5585, '<td valign="top">could be sharper</td>', 'could be sharper', '2003-04-17 17:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(269742, 18029, 5585, '<td valign="top">gosh, wonderful try....alot of work....wish it had more focus...and less contrast...great idea though..</td>', 'gosh, wonderful try....alot of work....wish it had more focus...and less contrast...great idea though..', '2003-04-17 17:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(269744, 18206, 5585, '<td valign="top">nice presentation...</td>', 'nice presentation...', '2003-04-17 17:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(269747, 18105, 778, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution.  Just a bit more contrast in the shadows and I feel this would have been the best!  But still a solid 9!  Good work!</td>', 'Great idea and execution.  Just a bit more contrast in the shadows and I feel this would have been the best!  But still a solid 9!  Good work!', '2003-04-17 17:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(269754, 18211, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really cute idea!  Remind me to not eat the bunnies at your house!  Very clear, colorful picture.  (You got telephone wires in the reflection, damn wires!)  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Really cute idea!  Remind me to not eat the bunnies at your house!  Very clear, colorful picture.  (You got telephone wires in the reflection, damn wires!)  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 17:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(269756, 18206, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice rich color.  Glare isn''t an issue.  Tiny nit:  sugar grains dot the background.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nice rich color.  Glare isn''t an issue.  Tiny nit:  sugar grains dot the background.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 17:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(269757, 17842, 1005, '<td valign="top">Extremely good focus, nice job!  A touch of glare, but not to the point of large distraction.  Color seems very good.  This is good enough for a score upgrade from 8 to 9.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Extremely good focus, nice job!  A touch of glare, but not to the point of large distraction.  Color seems very good.  This is good enough for a score upgrade from 8 to 9.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 17:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(269759, 18123, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well, the orange row seems to have an "extra" in there.  Focus is good at the front, but looses it rapidly to the back.  Lots of glare dots (two per candy) says you might want to try a "softer" light.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Well, the orange row seems to have an "extra" in there.  Focus is good at the front, but looses it rapidly to the back.  Lots of glare dots (two per candy) says you might want to try a "softer" light.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 17:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(269761, 18084, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really cool flare, I like it''s color.  Lots of negative space, near the 1/3 rule, but not quite.  The glare on the front of the glass is a tad harsh, but not a total killer.  <br/>8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Really cool flare, I like it''s color.  Lots of negative space, near the 1/3 rule, but not quite.  The glare on the front of the glass is a tad harsh, but not a total killer.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 17:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(269763, 18057, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  The glare is pretty soft.  focus is very strong.  Color seems pretty true.  Cropping - personal choice.  Overall, this is pretty good.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nicely done.  The glare is pretty soft.  focus is very strong.  Color seems pretty true.  Cropping - personal choice.  Overall, this is pretty good.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(269764, 17701, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, sharp photo.  I like your idea.  The glare spots are a tad harsh, but not as harsh as many have had.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very colorful, sharp photo.  I like your idea.  The glare spots are a tad harsh, but not as harsh as many have had.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(269765, 17986, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, sharp image.  I like everything but the messy (hard not to be) sugar laying around.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very colorful, sharp image.  I like everything but the messy (hard not to be) sugar laying around.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(269766, 18192, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the advertising.  I think I would have liked more candy falling (less needed below) and the "bowl" cropped out.  Lighting seems a little harsh on the pile of candy, too low for the falling candy.  Some odd results from the candy in motion.  It''s fun and interesting to look at.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice take on the advertising.  I think I would have liked more candy falling (less needed below) and the "bowl" cropped out.  Lighting seems a little harsh on the pile of candy, too low for the falling candy.  Some odd results from the candy in motion.  It''s fun and interesting to look at.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(269767, 18098, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear photo.  Color seems very nice.  While the "bite" is more natural, I would have liked a sharper cut on the bar (feels grossly half eaten).  I also would like to see a bit more of the wrapper (w/o a lot of excess glare).  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very clear photo.  Color seems very nice.  While the "bite" is more natural, I would have liked a sharper cut on the bar (feels grossly half eaten).  I also would like to see a bit more of the wrapper (w/o a lot of excess glare).  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(269768, 18144, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very colorful shot!  Focus seems good (though some parts of the yellow one seem less than totally sharp, but it might just be the candy).  Lighting isn''t too harsh.  Fun shot!  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very colorful shot!  Focus seems good (though some parts of the yellow one seem less than totally sharp, but it might just be the candy).  Lighting isn''t too harsh.  Fun shot!  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(269770, 18232, 1005, '<td valign="top">This seems like a really good idea, but looking at it....I dunno.  Focus is sharp, color is rich and true.  Background isn''t great, but well blurred, so not really an issue.  Glare off the gumball machines isn''t that bad.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'This seems like a really good idea, but looking at it....I dunno.  Focus is sharp, color is rich and true.  Background isn''t great, but well blurred, so not really an issue.  Glare off the gumball machines isn''t that bad.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(269786, 18184, 3469, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colors, just a little blown out on some places.</td>', 'Nice bright colors, just a little blown out on some places.', '2003-04-17 18:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(269790, 18199, 3469, '<td valign="top">nively captured eery feeling, well fitting to the title. Still a little bit too much ''constructed'' to make a deep impression.</td>', 'nively captured eery feeling, well fitting to the title. Still a little bit too much ''constructed'' to make a deep impression.', '2003-04-17 18:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(269792, 18270, 1005, '<td valign="top">Strongly stated photo!  Very nice color, nice use of negative space.  The glare spot on the gumball isn''t huge, but a bit bright (hard not to).  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Strongly stated photo!  Very nice color, nice use of negative space.  The glare spot on the gumball isn''t huge, but a bit bright (hard not to).  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(269794, 17804, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute idea!  Bears are very clear.  A bit of reflection off the glass.  Maybe swapping the green and light yellow bears would have been good (hide the glare a bit better).  Nice blue sky background.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cute idea!  Bears are very clear.  A bit of reflection off the glass.  Maybe swapping the green and light yellow bears would have been good (hide the glare a bit better).  Nice blue sky background.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(269796, 18153, 3469, '<td valign="top">Nice stretch of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice stretch of the challenge.', '2003-04-17 18:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(269797, 17749, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nicely arranged.  Very good color.  Focus seems pretty good.  (Did you inverse the image?  I feel like the M&amp;Ms are going to slide off)  Glare isn''t an issue (has been in so many).  I like the mirror background.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nicely arranged.  Very good color.  Focus seems pretty good.  (Did you inverse the image?  I feel like the M&Ms are going to slide off)  Glare isn''t an issue (has been in so many).  I like the mirror background.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(269798, 18109, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wonderful set up.  Very nice color.  Low/non-distracting glare on the candy canes (well done!!!)  I like your sugar bowl, looks nice against the black background.  9 Rob the Swash<br/>After reviewing all the photos, this seems like the best to me.  Score upgrade to 10!</td>', 'Wonderful set up.  Very nice color.  Low/non-distracting glare on the candy canes (well done!!!)  I like your sugar bowl, looks nice against the black background.  9 Rob the SwashAfter reviewing all the photos, this seems like the best to me.  Score upgrade to 10!', '2003-04-17 18:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(269799, 18119, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute, well created arrangement.  I want to like the background, but it seems unevenly light and somewhat out of focus (maybe placing the arrangement on a piece of glass, suspended about a foot off this background - net two good things - no out of place shadows and fully blurred background to make it more like a field of flowers in the distance).  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cute, well created arrangement.  I want to like the background, but it seems unevenly light and somewhat out of focus (maybe placing the arrangement on a piece of glass, suspended about a foot off this background - net two good things - no out of place shadows and fully blurred background to make it more like a field of flowers in the distance).  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(269800, 18165, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cool, interesting, delicate candy!  I like the lighting on the right, maybe using two lights from opposite sides?  Very good detail!!  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very cool, interesting, delicate candy!  I like the lighting on the right, maybe using two lights from opposite sides?  Very good detail!!  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(269802, 18251, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute idea! Main subjects are nicely focused.  Interesting use of glass and lighting from below (that said, I''m not too crazy about the extra figures created by that reflection).  I think the foremost Storm Trooper is excessive and tries to dominate the frame.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cute idea! Main subjects are nicely focused.  Interesting use of glass and lighting from below (that said, I''m not too crazy about the extra figures created by that reflection).  I think the foremost Storm Trooper is excessive and tries to dominate the frame.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(269809, 18202, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear photo.  (Maybe too clear)  The bite marks add a touch of realizm as do the smudges along the edges of the candy bar, but I\''m not crazy about the smudges (no idea how to aviod that!).  The crinkled wrapper also adds to the realizm, as does the chocolate scraps on the plate, leave the wrapper, clean up the flakes.  8 Rob the Swash<br/>(I realize these are pretty petty, nit-picky complaints, that''s why I didn''t lower your score down hard)</td>', 'Very clear photo.  (Maybe too clear)  The bite marks add a touch of realizm as do the smudges along the edges of the candy bar, but I\''m not crazy about the smudges (no idea how to aviod that!).  The crinkled wrapper also adds to the realizm, as does the chocolate scraps on the plate, leave the wrapper, clean up the flakes.  8 Rob the Swash(I realize these are pretty petty, nit-picky complaints, that''s why I didn''t lower your score down hard)', '2003-04-17 18:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(269813, 18249, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of showing both the wrapped candy and the unwrapped, open version, but the gooy part did run out into the wrapper (wasting tasty treats!)  The partial chocolate bunny used to hold up the wrapped egg leaves me wondering "what happened to the rest of the bunny?  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'I like the idea of showing both the wrapped candy and the unwrapped, open version, but the gooy part did run out into the wrapper (wasting tasty treats!)  The partial chocolate bunny used to hold up the wrapped egg leaves me wondering "what happened to the rest of the bunny?  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 18:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(269822, 18097, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting idea to color the white peppermints.   I''m afraid I just don''t like the detail of how this was done.  The red is too dark (makes the candy look out of focus - out of the picture).  The green is sloppy as the overlap is up front and hard to miss/dismiss.  I do like how the colored transparencies change the colors of the background paper, but the cylinders are so close, you can''t tell what the farther colors started out as.  Please don''t misunderstand, these critisizms are pretty much nits.  The photo is well taken, good focus and lighting (very little glare), but the nits add up to less than a perfect shot.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'It''s an interesting idea to color the white peppermints.   I''m afraid I just don''t like the detail of how this was done.  The red is too dark (makes the candy look out of focus - out of the picture).  The green is sloppy as the overlap is up front and hard to miss/dismiss.  I do like how the colored transparencies change the colors of the background paper, but the cylinders are so close, you can''t tell what the farther colors started out as.  Please don''t misunderstand, these critisizms are pretty much nits.  The photo is well taken, good focus and lighting (very little glare), but the nits add up to less than a perfect shot.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 19:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(269824, 17650, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool shot!  The cat is perfect!!  The falling M&amp;Ms would be very hard to pull off...you stopped their motion very well.  The yellow pieces seem a bit too bright (almost glaring).  The lower background seems a bit grainy, too.  For the most part I really love this shot and want to score it really highly.  I started this as an 8, I still think that''s the correct score.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'This is a very cool shot!  The cat is perfect!!  The falling M&Ms would be very hard to pull off...you stopped their motion very well.  The yellow pieces seem a bit too bright (almost glaring).  The lower background seems a bit grainy, too.  For the most part I really love this shot and want to score it really highly.  I started this as an 8, I still think that''s the correct score.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 19:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(269825, 18234, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract piece.  I do like looking through the transparent parts of the worms and their overlapping areas.  Tiny nit:  the extra sugar grains...maybe a tiny vacuum cleaner....?  Focus, color and lighting all seem very good.  I want to score this really highly, but the best I can go is an 8.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Interesting abstract piece.  I do like looking through the transparent parts of the worms and their overlapping areas.  Tiny nit:  the extra sugar grains...maybe a tiny vacuum cleaner....?  Focus, color and lighting all seem very good.  I want to score this really highly, but the best I can go is an 8.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 19:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(269827, 18115, 1005, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, liquor!  I really like the image created here.  Color and focus are very good.  I like your elements, nicely photographic.  The mood is fun, playful.  Tiny nit:  the fold in the background shows up (tisk, tisk).  I''ve convinced myself I like this better than the 8 that I started with.  How about 9?  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Mmmm, liquor!  I really like the image created here.  Color and focus are very good.  I like your elements, nicely photographic.  The mood is fun, playful.  Tiny nit:  the fold in the background shows up (tisk, tisk).  I''ve convinced myself I like this better than the 8 that I started with.  How about 9?  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 19:11:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(269831, 18243, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice clear photo.  (Everett area?)  Good color, lighting isn''t perfect (smidge dark in the corner), but this looks to be in a store, so what''s ya gonna do?  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice clear photo.  (Everett area?)  Good color, lighting isn''t perfect (smidge dark in the corner), but this looks to be in a store, so what''s ya gonna do?  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 19:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(269847, 17954, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear, nicely colorful photo.  I like the two hearts, as you can see through them to the bowl underneath.  The orange seems out of place...how would you measure it for the contest, off your tongue?  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very clear, nicely colorful photo.  I like the two hearts, as you can see through them to the bowl underneath.  The orange seems out of place...how would you measure it for the contest, off your tongue?  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 19:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(269849, 18105, 1005, '<td valign="top">Darn cools shot!  Nice use of white on white!  Clearity is very good.  Nice arrangement.  In fact, this impresses me to the extent of raising it''s score from 8 to 9.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Darn cools shot!  Nice use of white on white!  Clearity is very good.  Nice arrangement.  In fact, this impresses me to the extent of raising it''s score from 8 to 9.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 19:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(269852, 18178, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  I like the lips and the red vine and most of the background, but I get the feeling that the upper left is "blown out".  It shouldn''t matter, but grabs my attention, so that can''t be good.  Still, it''s an appealing shot overall.   8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cute idea.  I like the lips and the red vine and most of the background, but I get the feeling that the upper left is "blown out".  It shouldn''t matter, but grabs my attention, so that can''t be good.  Still, it''s an appealing shot overall.   8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 19:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(269853, 18258, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute idea!  I really like the eggs in the "nest" and the peeps looking in is a great touch, but the peeps seem a touch over exposed (more to the left than on the right).  The candy egg looks slightly molested, but not too bad.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cute idea!  I really like the eggs in the "nest" and the peeps looking in is a great touch, but the peeps seem a touch over exposed (more to the left than on the right).  The candy egg looks slightly molested, but not too bad.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 19:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(269855, 18075, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really cute.  Good focus.  Nice (a bit busy) background.  Color seems good on the basket and cloth, but the kisses seem overly saturated.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Really cute.  Good focus.  Nice (a bit busy) background.  Color seems good on the basket and cloth, but the kisses seem overly saturated.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-17 19:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(269877, 18211, 7890, '<td valign="top">I like your little bunnies here, great Idea, alittle over-exposed on their ears, but so cute of a composition.</td>', 'I like your little bunnies here, great Idea, alittle over-exposed on their ears, but so cute of a composition.', '2003-04-17 21:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(269879, 17843, 7890, '<td valign="top">neat comp here, the lighting is alittle distracting to me, good caption.</td>', 'neat comp here, the lighting is alittle distracting to me, good caption.', '2003-04-17 21:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(269893, 18129, 5705, '<td valign="top">Imteresting DOF Study</td>', 'Imteresting DOF Study', '2003-04-17 21:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(269894, 18251, 5705, '<td valign="top">LOL-- Great</td>', 'LOL-- Great', '2003-04-17 22:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(269896, 18029, 5705, '<td valign="top">How long did this take to set-up..</td>', 'How long did this take to set-up..', '2003-04-17 22:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(269899, 18206, 492, '<td valign="top">It is my personal impression that the colors are to dark.</td>', 'It is my personal impression that the colors are to dark.', '2003-04-17 22:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(269910, 18137, 6870, '<td valign="top">Sharp and in focus where it needs to be, though a a greater DOF might help, and nice background. Belongs in a magazine ad!</td>', 'Sharp and in focus where it needs to be, though a a greater DOF might help, and nice background. Belongs in a magazine ad!', '2003-04-17 22:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(269911, 17842, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot. Fun colors and creative use of background and foreground. The harsh spot of light is only slightly distracting. A quality image here.</td>', 'I like this image a lot. Fun colors and creative use of background and foreground. The harsh spot of light is only slightly distracting. A quality image here.', '2003-04-17 22:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(269915, 17650, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really fun photo. I appreciate how you put the candies front and center and not the cat. The cat''s eyes and expression are where they belong.</td>', 'Really fun photo. I appreciate how you put the candies front and center and not the cat. The cat''s eyes and expression are where they belong.', '2003-04-17 22:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(269916, 18123, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super idea, and well executed. The harsh light on the candies is a bit distracting, but the composition is fantastic, creating a lively, engaging image.</td>', 'Super idea, and well executed. The harsh light on the candies is a bit distracting, but the composition is fantastic, creating a lively, engaging image.', '2003-04-17 22:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(269917, 18214, 6870, '<td valign="top">I ain\''t touchin\'' it! Very clever idea. The red background adds to this image a lot. More \"mysterious\" lighting might enhance the \"danger\" implied here. Swell job!</td>', 'I ain\''t touchin\'' it! Very clever idea. The red background adds to this image a lot. More \"mysterious\" lighting might enhance the \"danger\" implied here. Swell job!', '2003-04-17 22:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(269918, 18125, 6870, '<td valign="top">Love that title! Opening the top candy is a nice touch. It would be nice to see these glitter more.</td>', 'Love that title! Opening the top candy is a nice touch. It would be nice to see these glitter more.', '2003-04-17 22:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(269919, 18144, 6870, '<td valign="top">The title is true! And you capture the color well. A greater depth of field would bring the yellow lolli into sharper focus.</td>', 'The title is true! And you capture the color well. A greater depth of field would bring the yellow lolli into sharper focus.', '2003-04-17 22:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(269920, 18084, 6870, '<td valign="top">Glint of the glass is fantastic, but I wish the candies were brighter. Fine line, and judgement call, perhaps. Great work here.</td>', 'Glint of the glass is fantastic, but I wish the candies were brighter. Fine line, and judgement call, perhaps. Great work here.', '2003-04-17 22:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(269922, 18062, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement! Your point of view confuses me slightly with the angles of the candies. Wonderful composition and colors. super work.</td>', 'Nice arrangement! Your point of view confuses me slightly with the angles of the candies. Wonderful composition and colors. super work.', '2003-04-17 22:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(269923, 18251, 6870, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh! Nice composition and the mirror adds a nice touch.</td>', 'Made me laugh! Nice composition and the mirror adds a nice touch.', '2003-04-17 22:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(269925, 17804, 6870, '<td valign="top">The backlighting and background work really well here in establishing the bright colors you need for this "dance."</td>', 'The backlighting and background work really well here in establishing the bright colors you need for this "dance."', '2003-04-17 22:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(269926, 18232, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice overall pattern created here. They seem so far away, though. It may be worth exploring to get a little closer and still see if the pattern can be retained while giving us a better look at the candy? Anyway, fun colors and nice work.</td>', 'Nice overall pattern created here. They seem so far away, though. It may be worth exploring to get a little closer and still see if the pattern can be retained while giving us a better look at the candy? Anyway, fun colors and nice work.', '2003-04-17 22:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(269930, 18088, 6870, '<td valign="top">B/W works well. I like this composition with the jacks, too. Seems to lose focus as it goes back. Still, nice work!</td>', 'B/W works well. I like this composition with the jacks, too. Seems to lose focus as it goes back. Still, nice work!', '2003-04-17 22:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(269931, 17749, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m seeing double! Aaaagh! No wait, that''s a mirror. Whew! Fun idea and arrangement, but the mirror does confuse things just a bit.</td>', 'I''m seeing double! Aaaagh! No wait, that''s a mirror. Whew! Fun idea and arrangement, but the mirror does confuse things just a bit.', '2003-04-17 22:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(269933, 18264, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun idea! Yellow is very saturated and difficult to focus on. Thankfully, there is a red candy there too. Very clear communication of this archetypal situation.</td>', 'Fun idea! Yellow is very saturated and difficult to focus on. Thankfully, there is a red candy there too. Very clear communication of this archetypal situation.', '2003-04-17 22:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(269934, 17706, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love how the paper from the kiss reinforces the image, and it is a stroke of genius how it moves toward the corner in just such a way. The foil seems out of focus, and I don''t really find these lips appealing. It may be the lighting you used (I''m sure the lips are just fine!).</td>', 'I love how the paper from the kiss reinforces the image, and it is a stroke of genius how it moves toward the corner in just such a way. The foil seems out of focus, and I don''t really find these lips appealing. It may be the lighting you used (I''m sure the lips are just fine!).', '2003-04-17 22:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(269935, 18270, 6870, '<td valign="top">Bold and strong. Perhaps diffusing the harsh light on the ball itself would help enhance this image, though I do like the strong shadows. Very  nice composition and cropping, too.</td>', 'Bold and strong. Perhaps diffusing the harsh light on the ball itself would help enhance this image, though I do like the strong shadows. Very  nice composition and cropping, too.', '2003-04-17 23:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(269938, 18146, 6870, '<td valign="top">I agree that fruit is nature''s candy, but THIS fruit seems old and not very appetizing. Perhaps you are positing that candy is better than fruit?</td>', 'I agree that fruit is nature''s candy, but THIS fruit seems old and not very appetizing. Perhaps you are positing that candy is better than fruit?', '2003-04-17 23:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(269939, 18224, 6870, '<td valign="top">Engaging arrangement, and the mirror works for this image. I''m not sure what that smoke/mist is supposed to accomplish, though.</td>', 'Engaging arrangement, and the mirror works for this image. I''m not sure what that smoke/mist is supposed to accomplish, though.', '2003-04-17 23:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(269942, 18180, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this image high marks, because I think it is appropriate and creative. You would do well to figure out how to make your image larger, though. There are a few threads in the Forums about how this is done.</td>', 'I''m giving this image high marks, because I think it is appropriate and creative. You would do well to figure out how to make your image larger, though. There are a few threads in the Forums about how this is done.', '2003-04-17 23:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(269944, 18184, 6870, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for these candies, but I''m still giving you high marks because I see that as irrelevant. This is a joyful, fun image that makes me happy. They seem slightly out of focus, but your arrangement and composition are great. The lighting works, too by adding definition but still retaining a happy mood.</td>', 'I don''t care for these candies, but I''m still giving you high marks because I see that as irrelevant. This is a joyful, fun image that makes me happy. They seem slightly out of focus, but your arrangement and composition are great. The lighting works, too by adding definition but still retaining a happy mood.', '2003-04-17 23:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(269948, 18199, 6870, '<td valign="top">Whew! I''m glad I balked at my idea of photographing glass candies! Elegant, intricate and lively colors. I think all of these could be increased on a different background, or perhaps with a bit closer cropping. Still, a fun image that captures the essence of candy.</td>', 'Whew! I''m glad I balked at my idea of photographing glass candies! Elegant, intricate and lively colors. I think all of these could be increased on a different background, or perhaps with a bit closer cropping. Still, a fun image that captures the essence of candy.', '2003-04-17 23:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(269949, 18093, 6870, '<td valign="top">The implications are staggering.... Really engaging idea. The title here really enhances the image, and i find myself looking around for clues to the title, that are easy to find here. Perhaps a darker mood would increase the connection even more.</td>', 'The implications are staggering.... Really engaging idea. The title here really enhances the image, and i find myself looking around for clues to the title, that are easy to find here. Perhaps a darker mood would increase the connection even more.', '2003-04-17 23:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(269950, 18266, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simple. This is, indeed, a candy corn. Shown in white isolation like this, it appears lonely and perhaps even rare--odd for the candy that comes in such abundance.</td>', 'Simple. This is, indeed, a candy corn. Shown in white isolation like this, it appears lonely and perhaps even rare--odd for the candy that comes in such abundance.', '2003-04-17 23:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(269953, 18057, 6870, '<td valign="top">This extreme close up implies that this joyful pattern goes on for some time, yet it also gives us a glimpse of the individual. Engaging.</td>', 'This extreme close up implies that this joyful pattern goes on for some time, yet it also gives us a glimpse of the individual. Engaging.', '2003-04-17 23:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(269954, 17986, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun colors and nice composition make this an engaging image. Perhaps more interesting light  (darker? at an angle?) would increase its interest even further.</td>', 'Fun colors and nice composition make this an engaging image. Perhaps more interesting light  (darker? at an angle?) would increase its interest even further.', '2003-04-17 23:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(269955, 18217, 6870, '<td valign="top">Whoa! interesting image. I can''t see how the plastic wrap enhances this photo much, though it does add interesting lights and textures. Your title implies a bold red, though, that is undermined by the plastic. Fun idea and good composition.</td>', 'Whoa! interesting image. I can''t see how the plastic wrap enhances this photo much, though it does add interesting lights and textures. Your title implies a bold red, though, that is undermined by the plastic. Fun idea and good composition.', '2003-04-17 23:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(269956, 18166, 6870, '<td valign="top">You''ve made these look good with dramatic lighting and interesting angles. Your point of view helps, too. The candy itself may be slightly overexposed, but this is a fine photo.</td>', 'You''ve made these look good with dramatic lighting and interesting angles. Your point of view helps, too. The candy itself may be slightly overexposed, but this is a fine photo.', '2003-04-17 23:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(269957, 18211, 6870, '<td valign="top">Funny! The tones you have here create a mood for me that says these bunnies are in dire straights. Or maybe it''s the expressions on their faces. The reflection is interesting, but I can''t see that it serves a purpose in this photo besides adding interest. I''d much rather consider the plight of the bunnies.</td>', 'Funny! The tones you have here create a mood for me that says these bunnies are in dire straights. Or maybe it''s the expressions on their faces. The reflection is interesting, but I can''t see that it serves a purpose in this photo besides adding interest. I''d much rather consider the plight of the bunnies.', '2003-04-17 23:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(269958, 18096, 6870, '<td valign="top">With your title, I would expect this to be a dark, brooding image. Instead, these are happy colors on a white background. the image says one thing and the title another. I''m supposing you took the picture first and then tried to think of a title?</td>', 'With your title, I would expect this to be a dark, brooding image. Instead, these are happy colors on a white background. the image says one thing and the title another. I''m supposing you took the picture first and then tried to think of a title?', '2003-04-17 23:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(269959, 17922, 6870, '<td valign="top">The plastic wrapping here adds some interest and a feeling of sterility, as if it came from a hospital. It also makes the candy seem like something we can''t get at; we can only look at it. I wish it were all in sharper focus.</td>', 'The plastic wrapping here adds some interest and a feeling of sterility, as if it came from a hospital. It also makes the candy seem like something we can''t get at; we can only look at it. I wish it were all in sharper focus.', '2003-04-17 23:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(269960, 18075, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun colors, enhanced by the background. Seems slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Fun colors, enhanced by the background. Seems slightly out of focus.', '2003-04-17 23:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(269961, 18212, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice idea; the figures really enhance this photo, making it clever and fun. I think that with more precise and perhaps diffused lighting, and a better backdrop than a Rubbermaid lid, the communication you''re going for could be even more enhanced.</td>', 'Nice idea; the figures really enhance this photo, making it clever and fun. I think that with more precise and perhaps diffused lighting, and a better backdrop than a Rubbermaid lid, the communication you''re going for could be even more enhanced.', '2003-04-17 23:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(270019, 17797, 6870, '<td valign="top">These are wonderful colors in an engaging arrangement. I also like how it is broken candy, giving us a fesh perspective. I wish they were in focus.</td>', 'These are wonderful colors in an engaging arrangement. I also like how it is broken candy, giving us a fesh perspective. I wish they were in focus.', '2003-04-18 01:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(270020, 18115, 6870, '<td valign="top">Elegant composition with clarity and interesting colors. I can take this two ways: (1) this is an offensive image to me suggesting that if you liquor a girl up, it is easier to have sex (basically: rape); (2) It''s just more fun with candy and booze. I''m assuming option 2, but please realize that your image does not distinguish between the two very well.</td>', 'Elegant composition with clarity and interesting colors. I can take this two ways: (1) this is an offensive image to me suggesting that if you liquor a girl up, it is easier to have sex (basically: rape); (2) It''s just more fun with candy and booze. I''m assuming option 2, but please realize that your image does not distinguish between the two very well.', '2003-04-18 01:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(270021, 17616, 6870, '<td valign="top">We all have one! This one looks diverse and well stocked! I wish it was all in glorious focus.</td>', 'We all have one! This one looks diverse and well stocked! I wish it was all in glorious focus.', '2003-04-18 01:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(270022, 17940, 6870, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and placement of the glass and candy, including the rotation of the glass. I can''t really see what purpose "chroming" this accomplishes, though.</td>', 'Excellent composition and placement of the glass and candy, including the rotation of the glass. I can''t really see what purpose "chroming" this accomplishes, though.', '2003-04-18 01:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(270030, 18115, 5585, '<td valign="top">good presentation....clear and sharp...</td>', 'good presentation....clear and sharp...', '2003-04-18 01:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(270033, 18085, 5585, '<td valign="top">cute idea....</td>', 'cute idea....', '2003-04-18 01:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(270048, 18264, 7466, '<td valign="top">Too bright</td>', 'Too bright', '2003-04-18 02:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(270057, 18153, 6405, '<td valign="top">I like The left one!</td>', 'I like The left one!', '2003-04-18 03:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
