(270097, 17986, 4517, '<td valign="top">One of the best ones, great macro and good colours. I think a bit more dof would have helped get the forground sweets in better focus, to me it looks like the green one is the only one in focus. Good luck</td>', 'One of the best ones, great macro and good colours. I think a bit more dof would have helped get the forground sweets in better focus, to me it looks like the green one is the only one in focus. Good luck', '2003-04-18 05:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
