(270121, 17804, 6230, '<td valign="top">Nice combination...are these candies? Bottom right half of the picture seems lighter and some reflections overall ruin the image.</td>', 'Nice combination...are these candies? Bottom right half of the picture seems lighter and some reflections overall ruin the image.', '2003-04-18 07:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
