(270127, 18013, 6230, '<td valign="top">It will have a better impact if the the bottom of the glass can be given a little more light to bring out the colours of those candies...</td>', 'It will have a better impact if the the bottom of the glass can be given a little more light to bring out the colours of those candies...', '2003-04-18 07:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(270141, 18029, 4049, '<td valign="top">great setup!!</td>', 'great setup!!', '2003-04-18 09:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(270169, 18164, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good actress! Looks like she''s really enjoying that chocolate bar. The light seems a bit  harsh on her and her hands, perhaps diffused would be more effective. Nice work.</td>', 'Good actress! Looks like she''s really enjoying that chocolate bar. The light seems a bit  harsh on her and her hands, perhaps diffused would be more effective. Nice work.', '2003-04-18 10:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(270255, 18165, 6900, '<td valign="top">Possibly the top shot of the week!  Excellent composition, beautiful subject, and good lighting.</td>', 'Possibly the top shot of the week!  Excellent composition, beautiful subject, and good lighting.', '2003-04-18 12:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(270277, 17797, 1379, '<td valign="top">Oh, wait!  I had to come back to this because it took me a second to get the title!  I want candy!  Clever!!</td>', 'Oh, wait!  I had to come back to this because it took me a second to get the title!  I want candy!  Clever!!', '2003-04-18 12:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(270413, 18098, 6870, '<td valign="top">The lighting for this image is great. Somehow, the candy does not look very appetizing, though. It may be you need to take a bit more time in making sure it oozes just right? Anyway, nice work.</td>', 'The lighting for this image is great. Somehow, the candy does not look very appetizing, though. It may be you need to take a bit more time in making sure it oozes just right? Anyway, nice work.', '2003-04-18 15:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(270415, 18029, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and pattern here. The lighting is well done, too, illuminating the colors but not over saturating them. I wish these candies were all in better focus.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and pattern here. The lighting is well done, too, illuminating the colors but not over saturating them. I wish these candies were all in better focus.', '2003-04-18 15:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(270416, 18138, 6870, '<td valign="top">Yum. I love these things. While many here will not consider these "candy," I think that they fit the challenge well in Japan, and that''s good enough for me.</td>', 'Yum. I love these things. While many here will not consider these "candy," I think that they fit the challenge well in Japan, and that''s good enough for me.', '2003-04-18 15:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(270418, 17701, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and fun composition. Lighting could be a bit harsh, but I love the arrangement and idea. Thanks for getting most of these in focus.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and fun composition. Lighting could be a bit harsh, but I love the arrangement and idea. Thanks for getting most of these in focus.', '2003-04-18 15:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(270420, 18278, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever visual pun! The touch of candy in can D is the perfect touch. Appears scientific, except that the letters are cartoony, so instead we get a cartoony scientific, with strange things possibly afoot. Nice work.</td>', 'Clever visual pun! The touch of candy in can D is the perfect touch. Appears scientific, except that the letters are cartoony, so instead we get a cartoony scientific, with strange things possibly afoot. Nice work.', '2003-04-18 15:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(270422, 18272, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern here, suggesting perhaps that either candy can come in endless supply, or that it is mass produced in a mysterious (ala the lighting) way. The lighting is nice and mysterious, taking our thoughts beyond the image itself, though the harsh light right in the middle distracts me somewhat. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice pattern here, suggesting perhaps that either candy can come in endless supply, or that it is mass produced in a mysterious (ala the lighting) way. The lighting is nice and mysterious, taking our thoughts beyond the image itself, though the harsh light right in the middle distracts me somewhat. Nice work.', '2003-04-18 15:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(270424, 18202, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice work. This image, with its clues of gold and crystal, suggest that chocolate is enticing and something to be desired. The lighting could enhance this, too, if it were not so bright, perhaps.</td>', 'Nice work. This image, with its clues of gold and crystal, suggest that chocolate is enticing and something to be desired. The lighting could enhance this, too, if it were not so bright, perhaps.', '2003-04-18 15:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(270425, 17917, 6870, '<td valign="top">From the title, you suggest that this dog feels ill, though he doesn''t look it. Still, there are clues in the many wrappers around him/her.</td>', 'From the title, you suggest that this dog feels ill, though he doesn''t look it. Still, there are clues in the many wrappers around him/her.', '2003-04-18 15:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(270428, 18262, 6870, '<td valign="top">If this were focused on the right things: the leg and candy instead of the metal jar part, this would be such a great image. Really creative and fun idea!</td>', 'If this were focused on the right things: the leg and candy instead of the metal jar part, this would be such a great image. Really creative and fun idea!', '2003-04-18 16:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
