(271155, 18214, 1031, '<td valign="top">They''d probably actually go for those marshmallow "peanuts"</td>', 'They''d probably actually go for those marshmallow "peanuts"', '2003-04-20 00:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(271156, 18270, 2553, '<td valign="top">Great composition - has almost an abstract feel to it.  I really like this much more on my second look.  The colors work well, the negative space is a terrific balance against the shadow of the candy.</td>', 'Great composition - has almost an abstract feel to it.  I really like this much more on my second look.  The colors work well, the negative space is a terrific balance against the shadow of the candy.', '2003-04-20 00:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(271158, 18232, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice colorful shot, with excellent focus.  The composition is good, and I like the border.</td>', 'Nice colorful shot, with excellent focus.  The composition is good, and I like the border.', '2003-04-20 00:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(271159, 18258, 2553, '<td valign="top">Cute concept; wonderful colors and good DOF.  Composition works; just gives me a weird feeling all those beady little eyes lookin'' at that egg!</td>', 'Cute concept; wonderful colors and good DOF.  Composition works; just gives me a weird feeling all those beady little eyes lookin'' at that egg!', '2003-04-20 00:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(271160, 18077, 1031, '<td valign="top">With this particular subject I''d prefer a deeper DOF -- at least on the crystals, which I think i/we expect to see sharp. I like the sticks OOF, so I guess I''d have tried to arrange the pieces so some of each color was in the focal plane. Good concept, nice colors.</td>', 'With this particular subject I''d prefer a deeper DOF -- at least on the crystals, which I think i/we expect to see sharp. I like the sticks OOF, so I guess I''d have tried to arrange the pieces so some of each color was in the focal plane. Good concept, nice colors.', '2003-04-20 00:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(271161, 18013, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space concept.  For me, there is not nearly enough light on the candy - it''s so dark that it''s barely noticeable.  Not crazy about the border- not enough contrast in color, and I don''t like the light blue line on just the top and the left side.</td>', 'I like the negative space concept.  For me, there is not nearly enough light on the candy - it''s so dark that it''s barely noticeable.  Not crazy about the border- not enough contrast in color, and I don''t like the light blue line on just the top and the left side.', '2003-04-20 00:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(271162, 18180, 2553, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that this is really in the spirit of the "candy" challenge.  On it''s own - the shot seems to be split in half, with half in focus and half out of focus.  The out of focus part looks like it could have been mostly cropped off, and it would have helped the shot.  I would have preferred to see a closer up shot to see the bee better.</td>', 'I don''t feel that this is really in the spirit of the "candy" challenge.  On it''s own - the shot seems to be split in half, with half in focus and half out of focus.  The out of focus part looks like it could have been mostly cropped off, and it would have helped the shot.  I would have preferred to see a closer up shot to see the bee better.', '2003-04-20 00:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(271163, 17616, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good colors, and mostly in focus.  This shot is a little too busy for me.  Just too much going on and too much to look at.</td>', 'Good colors, and mostly in focus.  This shot is a little too busy for me.  Just too much going on and too much to look at.', '2003-04-20 00:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(271164, 18212, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good color and focus, but what the heck are all those toys doing there?? I wouldn''t let them theivin'' boogers anywhere near MY candy!</td>', 'Good color and focus, but what the heck are all those toys doing there?? I wouldn''t let them theivin'' boogers anywhere near MY candy!', '2003-04-20 00:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(271166, 18266, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good focus, and interesting composition.  I like the concept, but would have preferred to see more light on the candy - possibly enough omni-directional light to get rid of most of the shadows; and boost the contrast a little to try to whiten up the background.</td>', 'Good focus, and interesting composition.  I like the concept, but would have preferred to see more light on the candy - possibly enough omni-directional light to get rid of most of the shadows; and boost the contrast a little to try to whiten up the background.', '2003-04-20 00:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(271167, 18206, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, and I like the shiny look of the candy, but I think it needs more light on the candy - the colors seem dark and dulled out.</td>', 'Nice colors, and I like the shiny look of the candy, but I think it needs more light on the candy - the colors seem dark and dulled out.', '2003-04-20 00:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(271168, 18153, 2553, '<td valign="top">Definitely not what I was looking for in the candy challenge, although I figured someone would try it.  Nice shot, but no cigar.</td>', 'Definitely not what I was looking for in the candy challenge, although I figured someone would try it.  Nice shot, but no cigar.', '2003-04-20 00:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(271172, 18165, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, but it just doesn''t come across in the photo, for me.   For the most part, focus is good.  I like the texture, the composition and the use of negative space.  I think the chocolate needed just a bit more light on the subject, from the front, to make the shot have a little more impact.</td>', 'I love the idea, but it just doesn''t come across in the photo, for me.   For the most part, focus is good.  I like the texture, the composition and the use of negative space.  I think the chocolate needed just a bit more light on the subject, from the front, to make the shot have a little more impact.', '2003-04-20 00:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(271173, 17917, 2553, '<td valign="top">Cute little dog, hope he didn''t eat all that!  Good color and composition, but overall the shot is a little too busy for my taste.</td>', 'Cute little dog, hope he didn''t eat all that!  Good color and composition, but overall the shot is a little too busy for my taste.', '2003-04-20 00:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(271183, 18129, 1031, '<td valign="top">I thought my new glasses were broken already! Nice concept, execution.</td>', 'I thought my new glasses were broken already! Nice concept, execution.', '2003-04-20 00:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(271186, 18109, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lovely "Bouquet." I like the way you retained the "edges" of the glass against the background.</td>', 'Lovely "Bouquet." I like the way you retained the "edges" of the glass against the background.', '2003-04-20 00:57:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(271188, 18165, 1031, '<td valign="top">Do you buy those or make them, maybe with a cheese plane?</td>', 'Do you buy those or make them, maybe with a cheese plane?', '2003-04-20 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(271193, 18258, 1031, '<td valign="top">But what if it hatches a bunny?</td>', 'But what if it hatches a bunny?', '2003-04-20 01:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(271197, 18264, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like everything except the amount of glare on the yellow candies. Diffusing the light might help.</td>', 'I like everything except the amount of glare on the yellow candies. Diffusing the light might help.', '2003-04-20 01:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(271199, 17749, 1031, '<td valign="top">Creative idea I hope to have a chance to "steal" sometime soon!</td>', 'Creative idea I hope to have a chance to "steal" sometime soon!', '2003-04-20 01:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(271202, 18243, 1031, '<td valign="top">Six cavities in every box! If you swing one of those from the stick end it might qualify as a deadly weapon.</td>', 'Six cavities in every box! If you swing one of those from the stick end it might qualify as a deadly weapon.', '2003-04-20 01:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(271203, 18031, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lighting/colors look a little odd to me -- flash used perhaps? I''m a little surpirsed to see the PEZ but no dispenser.</td>', 'Lighting/colors look a little odd to me -- flash used perhaps? I''m a little surpirsed to see the PEZ but no dispenser.', '2003-04-20 01:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(271207, 18199, 1031, '<td valign="top">Makes it all look like glass -- nice effect. If you invert the whole image it looks fluorescent, like one of those paintings airbrushed onto black velvet.</td>', 'Makes it all look like glass -- nice effect. If you invert the whole image it looks fluorescent, like one of those paintings airbrushed onto black velvet.', '2003-04-20 01:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(271211, 17842, 1031, '<td valign="top">"Deceptively simple" idea well-done.</td>', '"Deceptively simple" idea well-done.', '2003-04-20 01:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(271213, 18127, 1031, '<td valign="top">I once had a dog who liked avocado. Maybe we should start a thread on pet food fetishes.</td>', 'I once had a dog who liked avocado. Maybe we should start a thread on pet food fetishes.', '2003-04-20 01:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(271216, 17904, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think I''d either get WAY back and shoot a vast expanse of candy, or else get in closer and concentrate on one or two of these elements (probably the cylinders). As it is, it looks a little cluttered.</td>', 'I think I''d either get WAY back and shoot a vast expanse of candy, or else get in closer and concentrate on one or two of these elements (probably the cylinders). As it is, it looks a little cluttered.', '2003-04-20 01:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(271217, 18029, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the mosaic...maybe a teeny bit over-sharp for my taste.</td>', 'Nice job with the mosaic...maybe a teeny bit over-sharp for my taste.', '2003-04-20 01:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(271219, 17922, 1031, '<td valign="top">If you''d twist it slightly the glare spots would have made a smiley-face in the center. Otherwise, I think they''re a little too big and distracting.</td>', 'If you''d twist it slightly the glare spots would have made a smiley-face in the center. Otherwise, I think they''re a little too big and distracting.', '2003-04-20 01:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(271220, 18251, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised they''re not on a chessboard...Good job with exposure and focus.</td>', 'I''m surprised they''re not on a chessboard...Good job with exposure and focus.', '2003-04-20 01:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(271225, 18212, 1031, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. I''d try and straighten the lines on the background or use one without such strong lines. Might extend the idea by using some string to "tie it down" like in Gulliver''s Travels...</td>', 'Cute idea. I''d try and straighten the lines on the background or use one without such strong lines. Might extend the idea by using some string to "tie it down" like in Gulliver''s Travels...', '2003-04-20 01:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(271228, 18138, 1031, '<td valign="top">I haven''t had these in a long time--yum.</td>', 'I haven''t had these in a long time--yum.', '2003-04-20 01:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(271230, 17917, 1031, '<td valign="top">I believe chocolate contains something actually toxic to dogs -- I''d check with a veterinarian as it would take more than Alka-Seltzer...</td>', 'I believe chocolate contains something actually toxic to dogs -- I''d check with a veterinarian as it would take more than Alka-Seltzer...', '2003-04-20 01:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(271231, 18211, 1031, '<td valign="top">Finally, more people with a sense of humor! For the sake of "historical accuracy" I''d have tried lopping off their ears and replacing it with a red top-knot (marshmallow, jelly bean?). Or at least droop them so they look like the tribe of "Long-Ears."</td>', 'Finally, more people with a sense of humor! For the sake of "historical accuracy" I''d have tried lopping off their ears and replacing it with a red top-knot (marshmallow, jelly bean?). Or at least droop them so they look like the tribe of "Long-Ears."', '2003-04-20 01:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(271264, 18144, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent colour, lighting and texture combination.  Love how you have used the whole frame to cover all of the candy.  Excellent job and gl in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Excellent colour, lighting and texture combination.  Love how you have used the whole frame to cover all of the candy.  Excellent job and gl in this weeks challenge.', '2003-04-20 05:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(271266, 18084, 1829, '<td valign="top">Very well composed and I just love your idea here.  The little sparkle of light off the glass adds interest too.  Well achieved and GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Very well composed and I just love your idea here.  The little sparkle of light off the glass adds interest too.  Well achieved and GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-04-20 05:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(271267, 18127, 1829, '<td valign="top">LOL looks like this little fella loves the candy.  Very well composed and I love the idea too.  Well achieved.</td>', 'LOL looks like this little fella loves the candy.  Very well composed and I love the idea too.  Well achieved.', '2003-04-20 05:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(271268, 17804, 1829, '<td valign="top">Bright refreshing colours.  Excellent background colour against the candy.  Very well done and composition is just awesome.  This is COOL!!!</td>', 'Bright refreshing colours.  Excellent background colour against the candy.  Very well done and composition is just awesome.  This is COOL!!!', '2003-04-20 05:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(271269, 17842, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent creative idea here.  Just love it!!!  Nice candy colour against the white sugar crystals as well.  GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Excellent creative idea here.  Just love it!!!  Nice candy colour against the white sugar crystals as well.  GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-04-20 05:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(271270, 18057, 1829, '<td valign="top">Your picture makes me want to reach into the puter and just grab it and eat it.  This looks soooo good.  Your lighting, composition and colours are just awesome.  Very well done and GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Your picture makes me want to reach into the puter and just grab it and eat it.  This looks soooo good.  Your lighting, composition and colours are just awesome.  Very well done and GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-04-20 05:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(271271, 18211, 1829, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT!!!  Just love it!  Love the colour, composition and the humour behind it.  Very well done.</td>', 'EXCELLENT!!!  Just love it!  Love the colour, composition and the humour behind it.  Very well done.', '2003-04-20 05:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(271272, 18232, 1829, '<td valign="top">WOW take your pick.  I could go wild there...lol.  Excellent composition and of course colour.  Very well done.</td>', 'WOW take your pick.  I could go wild there...lol.  Excellent composition and of course colour.  Very well done.', '2003-04-20 06:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(271274, 18129, 1829, '<td valign="top">Now this is tricky, how did you achieve this?  Wonderful colours against the black background.  Composition is simple yet effective.  Nice framing as well.  GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Now this is tricky, how did you achieve this?  Wonderful colours against the black background.  Composition is simple yet effective.  Nice framing as well.  GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-04-20 06:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(271276, 18270, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of light and shadow.  The colour and composition is just awesome.  Very well done and GL in this weeks challenge 10 :)</td>', 'Excellent use of light and shadow.  The colour and composition is just awesome.  Very well done and GL in this weeks challenge 10 :)', '2003-04-20 06:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(271337, 17951, 6097, '<td valign="top">This is just the perfect shot for this challenge.  By far my favorite.  Excellent work.  I love the black and white conversion while keeping the red hue saturation.  Awesome!!!  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'This is just the perfect shot for this challenge.  By far my favorite.  Excellent work.  I love the black and white conversion while keeping the red hue saturation.  Awesome!!!  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-04-20 11:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(271361, 18208, 2634, '<td valign="top">there is a bit of a strange color cast. The shadows take away from the shot. Nice idea and angle though</td>', 'there is a bit of a strange color cast. The shadows take away from the shot. Nice idea and angle though', '2003-04-20 12:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(271362, 18251, 2634, '<td valign="top">cute and original idea. The head in the foreground takes away from the 2 in the back though.</td>', 'cute and original idea. The head in the foreground takes away from the 2 in the back though.', '2003-04-20 12:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(271393, 17951, 8037, '<td valign="top">Great image, and idea. Love it</td>', 'Great image, and idea. Love it', '2003-04-20 13:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(271395, 18262, 8037, '<td valign="top">Great idea would have been fantastic but it is not SHARP on the subject....</td>', 'Great idea would have been fantastic but it is not SHARP on the subject....', '2003-04-20 13:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(271491, 18084, 3247, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite. 10.  Near perfect if not for the glare to the upper right of the star.</td>', 'This is my favorite. 10.  Near perfect if not for the glare to the upper right of the star.', '2003-04-20 17:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(271494, 18088, 3247, '<td valign="top">Black and white is the right choice for this. Good that you didn''t center this. 8</td>', 'Black and white is the right choice for this. Good that you didn''t center this. 8', '2003-04-20 17:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(271496, 18214, 3247, '<td valign="top">Gooey but yummy1  Great focus.  The background is excellent.  I like the use of red.  Very good macro.</td>', 'Gooey but yummy1  Great focus.  The background is excellent.  I like the use of red.  Very good macro.', '2003-04-20 17:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(271500, 18251, 3247, '<td valign="top">Lu-u-u-ke! Wonderful focus on this macro.  Especially like the use of the mirror, it really adds to the whole.</td>', 'Lu-u-u-ke! Wonderful focus on this macro.  Especially like the use of the mirror, it really adds to the whole.', '2003-04-20 17:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(271504, 17706, 3247, '<td valign="top">With spot editing try applying a little blur to the skin to remove imperfections.  Following the rules,  this is a wonderful shot!</td>', 'With spot editing try applying a little blur to the skin to remove imperfections.  Following the rules,  this is a wonderful shot!', '2003-04-20 17:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(271506, 18105, 3247, '<td valign="top">The lighting!!  The foucus is great. beauty in white.</td>', 'The lighting!!  The foucus is great. beauty in white.', '2003-04-20 17:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(271507, 17951, 3247, '<td valign="top">Very much like the lighting.  As a portrait this really works, forget the candy.  A little less saturation on the plate of candy would be more natural.</td>', 'Very much like the lighting.  As a portrait this really works, forget the candy.  A little less saturation on the plate of candy would be more natural.', '2003-04-20 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(271509, 18013, 3247, '<td valign="top">The candy is too dark.  Either over expose more or a fill flash would help.</td>', 'The candy is too dark.  Either over expose more or a fill flash would help.', '2003-04-20 17:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(271512, 18153, 3247, '<td valign="top">No candy.</td>', 'No candy.', '2003-04-20 17:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(271513, 18180, 3247, '<td valign="top">Poor focus and composition.  No candy.</td>', 'Poor focus and composition.  No candy.', '2003-04-20 17:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(271514, 18264, 3247, '<td valign="top">Better focus is need on the yellow candy.  Good choice of frame and vey good lighting.  I would be too easy  to blow the candy out.</td>', 'Better focus is need on the yellow candy.  Good choice of frame and vey good lighting.  I would be too easy  to blow the candy out.', '2003-04-20 17:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(271515, 17922, 3247, '<td valign="top">Focus and glare are not good.  Good idea but poorly executed.</td>', 'Focus and glare are not good.  Good idea but poorly executed.', '2003-04-20 17:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(271517, 18278, 3247, '<td valign="top">Candy should be the subject and focus. Not found here.</td>', 'Candy should be the subject and focus. Not found here.', '2003-04-20 17:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(271520, 18234, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great abstract with wonderful colours. Backlighting it was inspirational.</td>', 'Great abstract with wonderful colours. Backlighting it was inspirational.', '2003-04-20 17:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(271521, 18232, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice colours. Good one.</td>', 'Good composition, nice colours. Good one.', '2003-04-20 17:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(271523, 18272, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and DOF. It''s not quite straight though</td>', 'Good lighting and DOF. It''s not quite straight though', '2003-04-20 17:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(271734, 18211, 1344, '<td valign="top">Robbery!</td>', 'Robbery!', '2003-04-21 01:03:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(271736, 17951, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wow! Thanks everyone. I think your suggestions below are specific and a good idea. Now that I can spot-edit, I can get rid of those traces of red that appear here and there in earlobes and nostril shadows! I never knew we had so much red all over our skins. And of course, I made a nice print for this couple. They were real troopers.</td>', 'Wow! Thanks everyone. I think your suggestions below are specific and a good idea. Now that I can spot-edit, I can get rid of those traces of red that appear here and there in earlobes and nostril shadows! I never knew we had so much red all over our skins. And of course, I made a nice print for this couple. They were real troopers.', '2003-04-21 01:04:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(271737, 17951, 6900, '<td valign="top">Congrats, David.  :)</td>', 'Congrats, David.  :)', '2003-04-21 01:05:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(271741, 17951, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good going, David.<br/></td>', 'Good going, David.', '2003-04-21 01:07:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(271743, 17951, 1717, '<td valign="top">this was one of only two 10''s i gave for this challenge.  congratulations on a beautiful photo and first place!</td>', 'this was one of only two 10''s i gave for this challenge.  congratulations on a beautiful photo and first place!', '2003-04-21 01:08:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(271744, 18105, 6325, '<td valign="top">You are on a roll (so to speak). Congratulations on this and your Weather shot.<br/> <br/>Dennis</td>', 'You are on a roll (so to speak). Congratulations on this and your Weather shot. Dennis', '2003-04-21 01:08:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(271745, 17951, 1344, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your 1st 1st!</td>', 'Congrats on your 1st 1st!', '2003-04-21 01:09:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(271746, 18144, 1880, '<td valign="top">Jodie,<br/> <br/>Nice image. I think this is really well done.<br/> <br/>Bob</td>', 'Jodie, Nice image. I think this is really well done. Bob', '2003-04-21 01:09:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(271747, 18105, 1344, '<td valign="top">2 2''s from paying members?  Show yourselves!</td>', '2 2''s from paying members?  Show yourselves!', '2003-04-21 01:10:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(271748, 18211, 3607, '<td valign="top">i gave you an ''8'' because while i thought the photo was just okay, it was such an original idea, met the challenge well, and i loved it - i''m so glad it did well.  congrats!<br/> <br/>ps - i guess my main complaint about the photo would be the shadow on one of the (leaning) bunnys and also even though i can see the water line is straight the bunnies seem to be at an off angle (one of those things that you only see later and don''t want to bother to go out and re-shoot to fix ;-)</td>', 'i gave you an ''8'' because while i thought the photo was just okay, it was such an original idea, met the challenge well, and i loved it - i''m so glad it did well.  congrats! ps - i guess my main complaint about the photo would be the shadow on one of the (leaning) bunnys and also even though i can see the water line is straight the bunnies seem to be at an off angle (one of those things that you only see later and don''t want to bother to go out and re-shoot to fix ;-)', '2003-04-21 01:11:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(271749, 17951, 7504, '<td valign="top">2 red ribbons and 1 blue in 4 challenges, you are on fire!  : )</td>', '2 red ribbons and 1 blue in 4 challenges, you are on fire!  : )', '2003-04-21 01:11:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(271753, 17842, 3607, '<td valign="top">i gave you a ''10'' - congrats for the great placement.  my one comment would have been about the shadow on the upper right part of the candy, but the sharpness of the suger and candy, the depth of focus, and the beautiful simplicity of the shot are all fantastic.  great job!</td>', 'i gave you a ''10'' - congrats for the great placement.  my one comment would have been about the shadow on the upper right part of the candy, but the sharpness of the suger and candy, the depth of focus, and the beautiful simplicity of the shot are all fantastic.  great job!', '2003-04-21 01:13:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(271756, 18105, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really nice work! So much impact from so few colors!</td>', 'Really nice work! So much impact from so few colors!', '2003-04-21 01:14:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(271758, 17842, 6870, '<td valign="top">Big Smiles for you! Congratulations!</td>', 'Big Smiles for you! Congratulations!', '2003-04-21 01:14:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(271762, 17843, 6870, '<td valign="top">Just checkin'' out some of my faves for this week. This photo still makes me happy!</td>', 'Just checkin'' out some of my faves for this week. This photo still makes me happy!', '2003-04-21 01:17:34.000000', NULL, 0),
